#. ~ Item name
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid "Forged Guts' Sword"
msgid_plural "Forged Guts' Swords"
msgstr[0] "仿·格斯之剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid ""
"This massive blade is your painstaking attempt to recreate Guts' legendary "
"sword, whispered about among survivors. Forged from hardened steel, it is "
"almost like the weapon said to have cut through dragons and apostles—if "
"those stories were true. Heavy, crude, and sharp, it reaches far and hits "
"hard: perfect for zombies or something worse."
msgstr ""
"这柄巨刃是你凭幸存者的传闻，尽力复刻格斯传奇之剑的成果。高碳钢锻成，若那些屠龙斩使徒的故事是真的，它倒也颇有几分相像。沉、糙、利，挥击又远又狠——对付丧尸或更糟的东西都合适。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "Dragonslayer"
msgid_plural "Dragonslayers"
msgstr[0] "龙杀剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "In Guts' hands, this massive blade handles as if it were much lighter than its size suggests, even when wielded with one hand. It was made to hew enemies apart, embodying strength and determination worthy of a legendary weapon."
msgstr "在格斯手中，这柄巨剑挥舞起来远比外观看着轻巧，即使只用一只手也能使用。它为斩裂敌人而生，凝聚着配得上传奇武器的力量与决心。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd's Sword"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu Zodd's Swords"
msgstr[0] "不死者佐德之剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid ""
"A colossal sword wielded by the fearsome Nosferatu Zodd. Forged in a brutal "
"style reminiscent of Kushan craftsmanship, it cleaves flesh and bone with "
"ease. Only the mightiest can wield it effectively."
msgstr "骇人的不死者佐德所使的巨剑。锻造风格凶悍，近似古式匠艺；切肉断骨毫不费力。只有最强者才配真正驾驭它。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/void_crystal.json
msgid "Void Crystal"
msgstr "虚空水晶"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/void_crystal.json
msgid "A dark crystal radiating a faint energy, left behind by Apostle Void."
msgstr "一枚幽暗的水晶，微微散发能量，为虚空使徒所留。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_helmet.json
msgid "Berserker Helmet"
msgstr "狂战士头盔"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_helmet.json
msgid "A heavy helmet that awakens fury and weighs on the wearer's mind."
msgstr "一顶沉重的头盔，唤醒怒火，也逐渐侵蚀佩戴者的心智。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_chestplate.json
msgid "Berserker Chestplate"
msgstr "狂战士胸甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_chestplate.json
msgid "A massive chestplate that turns pain into power."
msgstr "厚重的胸甲，用痛苦换取更强的力量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_gloves.json
msgid "Berserker Gloves"
msgstr "狂战士手套"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_gloves.json
msgid "Gloves that clench your fists with furious strength."
msgstr "将双拳箍进狂暴力量的手套。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armguards.json
msgid "Berserker Armguards"
msgstr "狂战士臂甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armguards.json
msgid "Armguards that protect your arms and feed your rage."
msgstr "护臂双臂，亦助长怒火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_legguards.json
msgid "Berserker Legguards"
msgstr "狂战士腿甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_legguards.json
msgid "Legguards that grant endurance as the armor's curse takes hold."
msgstr "赋予耐力的腿甲，盔甲的诅咒也随之逐渐侵蚀心智。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_boots.json
msgid "Berserker Boots"
msgstr "狂战士战靴"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_boots.json
msgid "Boots that trample enemies at the cost of exhaustion."
msgstr "踏碎敌人、也耗尽穿戴者的战靴。"

#. ~ Item name
#: monsterdrops/griffith_drops.json
msgid "Apostle Shard"
msgstr "使徒碎片"

#. ~ Item description
#: monsterdrops/griffith_drops.json
msgid ""
"A jagged fragment torn from an otherworldly being, pulsing with dark energy."
msgstr "锯齿状的碎片，脉动着黑暗能量，从异界生物身上剥落。"

#. ~ Item name
#: monsterdrops/beast_drops.json
msgid "Tainted Flesh"
msgstr "污秽血肉"

#. ~ Item description
#: monsterdrops/beast_drops.json
msgid ""
"A revolting lump of dark flesh that pulses faintly. It looks dangerous to "
"eat."
msgstr "一块令人作呕的暗色肉块，微微搏动。看起来不宜食用。"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】不死者佐德"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】不死者佐德"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你置身幽暗森林，沉重脚步与不死者佐德的咆哮已在林间回荡。这位渴求战斗的传奇使徒，从一开始就在猎杀你。这不仅是求生——而是一场赌命的决斗，每一秒都可能是最后一秒。你能靠策略躲开他的毁灭性打击、设伏诱敌，还是凭力量与狡诈正面对决？准备迎接一场史诗般的恶战吧——他的威能远超你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你置身幽暗森林，沉重脚步与不死者佐德的咆哮已在林间回荡。这位渴求战斗的传奇使徒，从一开始就在猎杀你。这不仅是求生——而是一场赌命的决斗，每一秒都可能是最后一秒。你能靠策略躲开他的毁灭性打击、设伏诱敌，还是凭力量与狡诈正面对决？准备迎接一场史诗般的恶战吧——他的威能远超你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "In the forest"
msgstr "森林中"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Griffith"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】与格里菲斯的对决"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Griffith"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】与格里菲斯的对决"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark forest, its silence broken only by rustling leaves and "
"heavy breathing. Reborn Griffith appears before you—a beautiful yet "
"terrifying white-winged being whose icy gaze cuts straight through you. This"
" is a fateful encounter with his dark power. His aura of terror weighs upon "
"you, but you are ready to fight with strength and will. Prepare to face a "
"demonic leader more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你站在幽暗森林里，只有叶沙沙声与粗重呼吸打破寂静。重生格里菲斯现身眼前——白翼华美而可怖，冰冷目光直刺心底。这是命运般的正面相遇，你将向他的黑暗力量发起挑战。恐惧与威压扑面而来，但你仍准备凭力量与意志一战。准备迎战这位魔性领袖——他的力量超越你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark forest, its silence broken only by rustling leaves and "
"heavy breathing. Reborn Griffith appears before you—a beautiful yet "
"terrifying white-winged being whose icy gaze cuts straight through you. This"
" is a fateful encounter with his dark power. His aura of terror weighs upon "
"you, but you are ready to fight with strength and will. Prepare to face a "
"demonic leader more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你站在幽暗森林里，只有叶沙沙声与粗重呼吸打破寂静。重生格里菲斯现身眼前——白翼华美而可怖，冰冷目光直刺心底。这是命运般的正面相遇，你将向他的黑暗力量发起挑战。恐惧与威压扑面而来，但你仍准备凭力量与意志一战。准备迎战这位魔性领袖——他的力量超越你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "In a dark forest"
msgstr "幽暗森林"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Encounter with the Skull Knight"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】骷髅骑士之遇"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Encounter with the Skull Knight"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】骷髅骑士之遇"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a wasteland surrounded by darkness and the ruins of an "
"ancient castle. Heavy breathing and ringing metal approach from afar. The "
"Skull Knight appears before you, a warrior in armor radiating dark power. "
"His magical attacks and mounted charge threaten your life. Prepare to battle"
" this legendary being with strength and ingenuity."
msgstr ""
"你来到一片荒原，四野昏沉，古堡废墟散落四周。远处传来沉重呼吸与金属撞击——骷髅骑士现身，黑甲战士周身萦绕黑暗之力。魔法攻击与骑乘冲锋皆能取你性命。在这崩坏世界里，凭力量与机智，准备与这位传奇存在展开史诗之战。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a wasteland surrounded by darkness and the ruins of an "
"ancient castle. Heavy breathing and ringing metal approach from afar. The "
"Skull Knight appears before you, a warrior in armor radiating dark power. "
"His magical attacks and mounted charge threaten your life. Prepare to battle"
" this legendary being with strength and ingenuity."
msgstr ""
"你来到一片荒原，四野昏沉，古堡废墟散落四周。远处传来沉重呼吸与金属撞击——骷髅骑士现身，黑甲战士周身萦绕黑暗之力。魔法攻击与骑乘冲锋皆能取你性命。在这崩坏世界里，凭力量与机智，准备与这位传奇存在展开史诗之战。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Ruined wasteland"
msgstr "崩坏荒原"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Apostle Void"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】对决虚空使徒"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Apostle Void"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】对决虚空使徒"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark, distorted dimension where the air trembles with psychic"
" energy. Apostle Void appears before you, his exposed brain radiating power "
"capable of twisting reality. His gaze pierces the soul and his aura crushes "
"the will. Prepare to confront this demonic leader with endurance and cunning"
" in a nightmare made real."
msgstr ""
"你站在黑暗扭曲的维度中，空气因灵能而颤动。虚空使徒现身——裸露的脑颅下，力量操纵现实。目光刺入灵魂，威压碾压意志。在这噩梦之境，凭韧性与狡智，准备与这位魔性领袖一战。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark, distorted dimension where the air trembles with psychic"
" energy. Apostle Void appears before you, his exposed brain radiating power "
"capable of twisting reality. His gaze pierces the soul and his aura crushes "
"the will. Prepare to confront this demonic leader with endurance and cunning"
" in a nightmare made real."
msgstr ""
"你站在黑暗扭曲的维度中，空气因灵能而颤动。虚空使徒现身——裸露的脑颅下，力量操纵现实。目光刺入灵魂，威压碾压意志。在这噩梦之境，凭韧性与狡智，准备与这位魔性领袖一战。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Distorted dimension"
msgstr "扭曲维度"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Heavy footsteps draw near..."
msgstr "沉重脚步正在逼近……"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "The darkness within the armor comes alive and lunges at you!"
msgstr "盔甲内的黑暗苏醒，向你扑来！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Reborn Griffith appears in a flare of dark power!"
msgstr "重生格里菲斯在黑暗力量中现身！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Reborn Griffith stands before you—his wings gleam and his gaze is cold with "
"resolve. The second encounter has begun!"
msgstr ""
"重生格里菲斯现身眼前，\n"
"白翼闪耀，目光冷峻。\n"
"第二次相遇开始了！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Poison from the Beast of Darkness' flesh courses through you!"
msgstr "黑暗恶魔的血肉之毒正在侵蚀你！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/void_apostle_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Apostle Void emerges from the warped air, his brain pulsing with energy!"
msgstr ""
"扭曲的空气中浮现虚空使徒，\n"
"裸露的脑颅脉动着能量！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/skull_knight_eoc.json
msgid ""
"An unnatural darkness surrounds you, and monsters emerge from the shadows!"
msgstr ""
"暗之存在包围了你，\n"
"魔物从阴影中现身！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/skull_knight_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The Skull Knight steps from the shadows, his armor clanking and his aura "
"terrifying!"
msgstr ""
"骷髅骑士从阴影中走出，\n"
"甲胄铿锵，威压逼人！"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/nosferatu_zodd.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu Zodds"
msgstr[0] "不死者佐德"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/nosferatu_zodd.json
msgid ""
"An enormous armored demon known as Nosferatu Zodd. This apostle possesses "
"inhuman strength and an insatiable lust for battle. His body is covered in "
"battle scars, and his eyes burn with the fire of war."
msgstr "身披铠甲的巨硕恶魔，人称不死者佐德。这位使徒拥有非人之力与对战火的渴求；躯体布满战痕，双眼燃烧着战争之火。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/griffith_reborn.json
msgid "Reborn Griffith"
msgid_plural "Reborn Griffiths"
msgstr[0] "重生格里菲斯"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/griffith_reborn.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful winged being with an icy gaze. His presence inspires terror, and"
" his movements are lightning-fast."
msgstr "白翼华美、目光冰冷的存在。其威压令人战栗，动作快如闪电。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/mon_skull_knight.json
msgid "Skull Knight"
msgid_plural "Skull Knights"
msgstr[0] "骷髅骑士"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/mon_skull_knight.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious warrior in skull-like armor, wielding magical power and riding "
"a faithful steed. He attacks with grim resolve."
msgstr "神秘战士，骷髅形甲胄，身怀魔法，坐骑忠诚。以阴沉决意发起攻击。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/mon_void_apostle.json
msgid "Apostle Void"
msgid_plural "Apostles Void"
msgstr[0] "虚空使徒"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/mon_void_apostle.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious apostle with an exposed brain who radiates a sinister power. "
"His psychic attacks and manipulation of reality inspire terror."
msgstr "脑颅裸露的神秘使徒，散发幽暗力量；心灵攻击与扭曲现实令人胆寒。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/beast_of_darkness_1.json
msgid "Beast of Darkness"
msgid_plural "Beasts of Darkness"
msgstr[0] "黑暗恶魔"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/beast_of_darkness_1.json
msgid ""
"A black shadow entity with burning eyes, embodying the dark power of the "
"Berserker Armor. It thirsts for the blood of its host."
msgstr "黑色影形，双眼燃火，是狂战士甲黑暗之力的化身；渴求穿戴者的鲜血。"

#. Name of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "Berserker Armor Activation"
msgstr "狂战士甲激活"

#. Description of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "The dark power of the Berserker Armor flows through you."
msgstr "狂战士甲的黑暗力量在你体内涌动。"

#. Apply message of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "You feel the armor's dark energy awaken."
msgstr "你感到盔甲中的黑暗能量正在苏醒。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Rend Space"
msgstr "空间裂斩"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "A magical strike that deals damage within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "魔法打击，对半径 3 格内造成伤害。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Aura of Despair"
msgstr "绝望光环"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "A chilling aura that briefly stuns nearby enemies within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "寒冷光环，短暂震慑半径 3 格内的敌人。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Aura of Behelit Consumption"
msgstr "贝黑莱特吞噬光环"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Weakens enemies within a 5-tile radius, briefly stunning them."
msgstr "削弱半径 5 格内的敌人，造成短暂震慑。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Psychic Attack"
msgstr "心灵攻击"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid ""
"A mental assault that briefly causes pain and disorientation within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "精神冲击，在半径 3 格内短暂造成疼痛与迷失。"

