#. October 2 playtest repairs
msgid "Flora: The sanctuary is under attack. Escape beyond the grove by the west road or south garden."
msgstr "弗洛拉：圣所正遭进攻，从西路或南园逃出林地。"

#. October 2 playtest repairs
msgid "Griffith stands before you, silent and untouched by the slaughter. The sight of him drives you into a blind rage. Demons close in from every side and seize your left wrist. You hack through your own wrist to tear free as claws rake your scarred face. You stagger free, your scarred face wet with blood."
msgstr "格里菲斯站在面前，沉默着，屠杀没有伤他分毫。看到他使你陷入狂怒。恶魔扑向你。你砍断自己的手腕，挣脱了束缚。利爪划过伤痕累累的脸。你踉跄着，却仍站着。鲜血顺着脸流下。"

#. October 2 playtest repairs
msgid "Griffith stands before you, silent and untouched by the slaughter. The sight of him drives you into a blind rage. Demons close in from every side and seize your left wrist. You hack through your own wrist to tear free; a claw destroys one eye as you wrench yourself out of their grip. You stumble free, blood running down your face."
msgstr "格里菲斯站在面前，沉默着，屠杀没有伤他分毫。看到他使你陷入狂怒。恶魔扑向你。你砍断自己的手腕，挣脱了束缚。利爪毁掉了你的一只眼睛。你踉跄着，却仍站着。鲜血顺着脸流下。"

