msgid "Griffith stands before you, silent and untouched by the slaughter. The sight of him drives you into a blind rage. Demons close in from every side. You wrench your already ruined left arm from their grip, but a claw destroys one eye. You stumble free, blood running down your face."
msgstr "格里菲斯站在面前，沉默着，屠杀没有伤他分毫。看到他使你陷入狂怒。恶魔扑向你。你把残损的手臂从它们手中挣脱。利爪毁掉了你的一只眼睛。你踉跄着，却仍站着。鲜血顺着脸流下。"

