msgid "A burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road."
msgstr "这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nCompleted: the local breach is sealed and its reward has been claimed.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n已完成：当地裂隙已封闭，奖励已领取。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nCompleted: the local breach is sealed and its reward has been claimed.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n已完成：当地裂隙已封闭，奖励已领取。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: examine the sealed mark and take the relic.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：检查封闭的印记并取走遗物。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: examine the sealed mark and take the relic.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：检查封闭的印记并取走遗物。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: examine the exposed wound and seal the breach.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：检查暴露的伤口并封闭裂隙。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: examine the exposed wound and seal the breach.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：检查暴露的伤口并封闭裂隙。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: defeat the keeper; keep a route for retreat.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：击败守护者并保留退路。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: defeat the keeper; keep a route for retreat.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：击败守护者并保留退路。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: find the place and inspect its approaches.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：找到地点并勘察入口。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold\n\nA burned military stronghold remains at the end of this road.\n\nNow: find the place and inspect its approaches.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞\n\n这条道路的尽头是一座被烧毁的军事据点。\n\n当前：找到地点并勘察入口。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert’s forge"
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特的锻坊"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A master smith and a young engineer work at the woodland forge."
msgstr "一位锻造大师和一位年轻机械师在林间锻坊工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Now: review your orders or ask the masters about repairs and preparations."
msgstr "当前：查看订单，或向工匠询问修理与准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Now: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters."
msgstr "当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert’s forge\n\nA master smith and a young engineer work at the woodland forge.\n\nNow: review your orders or ask the masters about repairs and preparations.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特的锻坊\n\n一位锻造大师和一位年轻机械师在林间锻坊工作。\n\n当前：查看订单，或向工匠询问修理与准备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert’s forge\n\nA master smith and a young engineer work at the woodland forge.\n\nNow: review your orders or ask the masters about repairs and preparations.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特的锻坊\n\n一位锻造大师和一位年轻机械师在林间锻坊工作。\n\n当前：查看订单，或向工匠询问修理与准备。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert’s forge\n\nA master smith and a young engineer work at the woodland forge.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特的锻坊\n\n一位锻造大师和一位年轻机械师在林间锻坊工作。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert’s forge\n\nA master smith and a young engineer work at the woodland forge.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The trail is preserved above."
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特的锻坊\n\n一位锻造大师和一位年轻机械师在林间锻坊工作。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n地点：尚未确定。已知线索保存在上方。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*Choose a place you know. Each hunt keeps its own progress."
msgstr "*选择已知地点。每场狩猎都保留各自的进度与结果。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot: battle sword."
msgstr "格多：战剑。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Rickert: arm cannon."
msgstr "里凯尔特：义肢炮。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot: Dragonslayer."
msgstr "格多：龙杀剑。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Rickert: crossbow bolts."
msgstr "里凯尔特：弩矢。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Ask Godot about the blade and the metal he needs."
msgstr "向格多询问这把剑及其所需金属。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*Choose a defensible place, prepare water, light and bedding, and keep an escape route. Record readiness by inspecting the protective sign at your shelter."
msgstr "*选择可防守的地点，备好水、照明和床铺，并保留退路。在庇护所检查已建的防护标记，可记录准备情况。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Your shelter preparations are recorded. Check your supplies before resting."
msgstr "庇护所的准备已记录。休息前检查物资。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "No shelter preparations have been recorded yet."
msgstr "尚未记录庇护所的准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Preparing a place to rest."
msgstr "准备休息地点。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What can a protective sign do?"
msgstr "防护标记能做什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Show my shelter on the map."
msgstr "在地图上显示庇护所。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "My first night."
msgstr "第一夜。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Quieted areas."
msgstr "平静的区域。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A bone and stone sign limits the Brand’s new nighttime summons within 8 local tiles on the same level. It does not stop existing demons, zombies or the armor’s shadows. Keep your sleeping place within its reach. The sign needs no fuel."
msgstr "骨石标记会抑制同一楼层8格内由烙印引来的新夜间显现。它无法阻挡已存在的恶魔、丧尸或铠甲的影子。睡铺应位于它的作用范围内。标记不需要燃料。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A dawn at your shelter is recorded. Rest and prepare for the next road."
msgstr "在庇护所迎来黎明已被记录。休息并为下一段旅程做准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "No dawn at the shelter has been recorded yet. You can still follow your known trails."
msgstr "尚未记录在庇护所迎来的黎明。你仍可追寻已知线索。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Sealed breaches quiet new world incursions for roughly two overmap tiles around each site. Demons already present remain, and the Brand and armor follow their own rules. Choose an area to show."
msgstr "封闭的裂隙会减弱各地点周围约两个大地图格内的新世界显现。已出现的恶魔仍然存在，烙印与铠甲也继续依照各自规则作用。选择要显示的区域。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A new entry has been added to your road journal."
msgstr "道路日志中新增了一条记录。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Between the burned edges are a broken road, a ruined foundation and marks around a split in the ground. The hollow’s keeper carried this route to another breach."
msgstr "烧焦的边缘之间可辨认出断路、废墟地基和地面裂缝周围的标记。洼地的守护者携带着通往另一处裂隙的路线。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Return to the surface to clarify this route."
msgstr "返回地面以确认这条路线。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We lost the wheel before sunset. The others carried the grain north, leaving the iron here. I heard something following the wheels, but the track behind us was empty. If we return, we will look beneath the bound box first."
msgstr "日落前我们失去了一个车轮。其他人把粮食搬往北方，把铁留在这里。我听到有东西追着车轮走，但身后的车辙空无一物。如果能回来，我们会先查看绑好的箱子下面。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "wagon tally"
msgstr "货车清单"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The open clearing is watched. I saw the trees move while the air was still. I tied the pack above the washout and took the lower path to see whether the other bank was clear. If I fail to return, keep to stone and leave room to turn back."
msgstr "有人盯着那片空地。空气静止时，我却看见树木在移动。我把背包系在冲沟上方，沿低处的小径去查看对岸是否安全。如果我没有回来，就沿石地走，并留好退路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "scout's field scrap"
msgstr "侦察员的野外笔记"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We leave before the next dusk. The children slept beneath the branches, and the water is still clean. Whoever follows us may need the blanket more than we do. There were cries beyond the track last night. We did not go to look."
msgstr "我们会在下一次黄昏前离开。孩子们睡在树枝下，水还干净。后来的人也许比我们更需要那条毯子。昨夜道路另一边传来哭喊声。我们没有去看。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "message from the waycamp"
msgstr "路边营地的留言"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*Choose an account you have read."
msgstr "*选择读过的见闻。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Roadside accounts."
msgstr "路边见闻。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The search for the Behelit."
msgstr "寻找贝黑莱特。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Accounts of the Eclipse."
msgstr "蚀的见闻。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Accounts from the hunts."
msgstr "狩猎见闻。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Flora’s writings and keepsakes."
msgstr "芙萝拉的记录与纪念物。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*Accounts appear here after you read them. The paper itself can be kept as a memory or left behind."
msgstr "*读过的见闻保存在这里。纸张本身可以留作纪念，也可以留下。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "road journal"
msgstr "道路日志"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Known roads, forge orders, shelter preparations and accounts you have read. Activate to open your journal."
msgstr "已知道路、锻坊订单、庇护所准备和读过的见闻。激活以打开日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Old notes from your journey. Activate to review the corresponding entries in your road journal."
msgstr "旅途中的旧笔记。激活以查看道路日志中的相应条目。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Read the burned scrap."
msgstr "阅读烧焦的纸片。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A charred scrap bearing a route through broken roads and ruined stone. Reading it preserves the trail in your road journal."
msgstr "烧焦的纸片上标着穿过断路与石砌废墟的路线。读过的线索会保存在道路日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The wound cools and its heartbeat stops. The surroundings have grown quieter, but your Brand remains. The defenders’ surviving marks name three trails: the Count’s residence, the Black Dogs’ camp and a misty valley. They are preserved in your road journal."
msgstr "伤口冷却，心跳停止。周边变得平静，但烙印仍在。昔日守卫留下的标记提到三条路线：伯爵的宅邸、黑犬营地和迷雾山谷。这些线索已保存在道路日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Review the roads and work I know."
msgstr "查看已知道路与工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "These directions do not yet reveal the road. The record has been kept."
msgstr "这些指引暂时无法确定道路。记录已保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I need a new road journal."
msgstr "我需要一本新的道路日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Choose a defensible place, prepare water, light and bedding, and keep an escape route. Check your supplies before resting."
msgstr "选择可防守的地点，备好水、照明和床铺，并保留退路。休息前检查物资。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Two roads are marked on the map. One bears the Black Dogs’ camp and Wyald’s name; the other, a mist-filled valley and Rosine’s name. Notes along the edges describe missing wagons and roads that have been closed."
msgstr "地图上标着两条道路。一条写着黑犬营地与瓦尔德的名字，另一条写着迷雾山谷与罗西妮的名字。边缘的笔记记录着失踪的货车和封闭的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Open the road journal."
msgstr "打开道路日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Show me the iron and tell me what it must endure. A blade and a repair are different jobs."
msgstr "把铁拿给我看，告诉我它要承受什么。锻造新剑和修理旧剑是两回事。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Back to the topics."
msgstr "返回话题。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A good order is plain: what you need, what you have brought, and what remains for me to do."
msgstr "好委托很简单：你需要什么、带来了什么，以及我还要做什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Open my road journal."
msgstr "打开旅行日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The forge gives me work worth doing. Ask what you came to ask; the coals will keep."
msgstr "锻炉给我值得做的工作。问你想问的吧，炭火等得起。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Weapons and work."
msgstr "武器与工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Current orders."
msgstr "当前委托。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Life at the forge."
msgstr "锻炉旁的生活。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "About Rickert."
msgstr "关于里凯尔特。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I kept the design. Bad judgment does not erase good work. The measurements remind me to think about the hands that will carry my iron, not only the order I was given."
msgstr "我保留了设计。错误的判断不能抹去出色的工艺。这些尺寸提醒我考虑举起铁器的双手，而不只是客户的要求。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why keep that design?"
msgstr "为什么保留这个设计？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We can go over the fittings for your arm or the bolts for your crossbow. Bring the materials to me when you have them."
msgstr "我们可以讨论义肢配件或弩箭。收齐材料后带给我。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I remember the people I traveled with. We can talk about them, if you are ready."
msgstr "我记得那些与我同行的人。如果你准备好了，我们可以谈谈他们。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Prosthesis and mechanisms."
msgstr "义肢与机械。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Orders and help."
msgstr "委托与帮助。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Band of the Hawk."
msgstr "鹰之团。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tell me about yourself."
msgstr "谈谈你自己。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I have made a prosthesis like this myself."
msgstr "我自己造过这样的义肢。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You made a mechanism like this with one hand? Those joints are not easy to fit with two. That is good work."
msgstr "你单手做出了这样的机械？这些关节用两只手也不容易装好。干得好。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You built one yourself? Good work. The fit of the joints matters more than a boast."
msgstr "你自己造了一只？干得好。关节的配合比夸口更有说服力。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Keep the fittings clean. A sound mechanism deserves care, whoever made it."
msgstr "保持配件清洁。无论是谁造的，可靠的机械都值得保养。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You made it with one hand? Hah! Those joints took skill. Keep that skill alive."
msgstr "你单手造的？哈！这些关节需要本事。别丢下这门手艺。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You made it yourself? Clean work. Watch the fit more than the polish."
msgstr "你自己造的？做得利落。注意配合，别只看抛光。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The fitting matters more than a fine polish. Keep it in good order."
msgstr "配合比漂亮的抛光更重要。好好保养它。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You said mercenaries and beasts surrounded you, and Griffith was taken. I keep thinking he might return. Tell me more about the others when you can."
msgstr "你说佣兵和野兽包围了你们，格里菲斯被带走了。我总想着他也许会回来。等你能说时，再告诉我其他人的事。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You have not told me what happened. I will not force you, but not knowing makes every empty place at the hearth harder to bear."
msgstr "你还没有告诉我发生了什么。我不会逼你，但未知让炉边每一个空位都更难承受。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You said almost everyone died in the attack. I cannot count the missing from here. Judeau, Pippin, Corkus and Gaston have not returned. I still do not know what became of Griffith."
msgstr "你说袭击中几乎所有人都死了。我无法在这里清点失踪者。捷度、比宾、哥尔卡斯和加斯顿都没回来。我仍不知道格里菲斯怎么样了。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I do not know. You have not told me enough to count the dead. Judeau, Pippin, Corkus and Gaston are still missing. I will not turn every empty place into a grave before I know."
msgstr "我不知道。你告诉我的还不足以清点死者。捷度、比宾、哥尔卡斯和加斯顿仍然失踪。我不愿在弄清楚前把每个空位都当成坟墓。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "This tree has sheltered many travelers. Its roots give me a place to work, and its shade reminds me that knowledge should help something live."
msgstr "这棵树庇护过许多旅人。它的根给我工作的地方，树荫提醒我，知识应当帮助生命。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why make your home beside this tree?"
msgstr "为什么住在这棵树旁？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What do you keep in your books?"
msgstr "你的书里记载了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A home grows through care. The tree guards this grove; we tend the roots, the garden and those who come weary to the door. Protection alone would leave only an empty shell."
msgstr "家靠照料成长。树守护树林，我们照料根、花园，以及疲惫来到门前的人。只有防护，这里也不过是空壳。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Observations, mistakes, and things others entrusted to me. A recipe may mend a wound; a remembered mistake may prevent one. You may ask about them, but please leave the books where another reader can find them."
msgstr "观察、错误，以及别人托付给我的知识。药方能治伤，记住错误能避免伤害。你可以询问，但请把书留给下一位读者。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Brand and the night."
msgstr "烙印与夜晚。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Help and preparation."
msgstr "帮助与准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Known dangers."
msgstr "已知的危险。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "May I ask about you and your home?"
msgstr "可以谈谈你和你的家吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You should know both what the armor gives and what it asks. Which troubles you most?"
msgstr "你应当了解铠甲给予什么，又索取什么。你最担心哪一点？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What does the armor do?"
msgstr "铠甲能做什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I have the complete armor. What should I know?"
msgstr "我已有整套铠甲。该知道些什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "First decide whether to accept the armor. Then I can prepare your charm. You may still rest, equip yourself and gather your belongings. When you awaken the charm here, you will leave this quiet interval behind; do not do so until you are ready to face danger."
msgstr "先决定是否接受铠甲，然后我可以准备护符。你仍可休息、穿戴装备并收拾物品。在这里唤醒护符就意味着结束这段平静时光；准备好面对危险后再做。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Prepare the charm. I will finish gathering my things before continuing."
msgstr "请准备护符。我收拾好东西后再继续。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Let us discuss my preparations."
msgstr "谈谈我的准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The charm is ready. Keep it while you rest and gather your supplies. Awaken it here when you are ready to finish preparing and continue your journey into danger. Until then we may talk."
msgstr "护符已经准备好。休息和收拾物资时带着它。准备好结束休整、继续危险旅程时，在这里唤醒它。在那之前我们还可以交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A paper charm prepared by Flora. Finish your rest, equip yourself and gather what you need before awakening it at her home. Its awakening ends your preparations and carries you into the next dangerous part of your journey."
msgstr "芙萝拉准备的纸护符。在她家中唤醒它之前，先休息、穿戴装备并带齐所需物品。唤醒护符会结束准备，带你进入旅程下一段危险的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We can consider the roads you already know. Choose one, and leave yourself a way to return."
msgstr "我们可以考虑你已知的道路。选一条，并给自己留好退路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "First hunt"
msgstr "初次狩猎"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The ashen breach"
msgstr "灰烬裂隙"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Black Dogs’ camp"
msgstr "黑犬营地"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The misty valley"
msgstr "迷雾山谷"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge"
msgstr "林间锻坊"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Follow the evidence you have found. Each keeper holds a different wound; closing one gives its surroundings a respite."
msgstr "沿着你找到的证据走。每位守护者占据不同的伤口；封闭其中一道，只能让附近喘息。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Look through what the apostle left behind. The recovered traces may tell you where its prey disappeared."
msgstr "查看使徒留下的东西。找到的痕迹也许能说明它的猎物去了哪里。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Look up the road to the forge."
msgstr "查看去锻坊的路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Recover, then choose an unfinished road you know. There is no need to pursue every trail at once."
msgstr "恢复体力，再选择一条已知且尚未完成的道路。不必一次追寻所有线索。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Follow the known trail to the Count’s residence. Examine the grounds before descending."
msgstr "沿已知线索去伯爵宅邸。下到地下前先查看院落。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Prepare for the Black Dogs’ camp. Look for a route that leaves you room to withdraw."
msgstr "为黑犬营地做好准备。选一条留有退路的路径。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Follow the known trail to the misty valley. Study the approaches before entering its deeper woods."
msgstr "沿已知的线索去迷雾山谷。进入深林前先观察入口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Prepare for the stronghold recorded in your journal. Bring protection against heat and a way to retreat."
msgstr "为日志中的要塞做好准备。带上隔热防护，想好退路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Seek counsel at the spiritual tree. If you are already there, rest and ask Flora what help she can offer."
msgstr "去灵树旁寻求建议。如果你已在那里，就休息并问芙萝拉能提供什么帮助。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Follow the recovered trail to the ashen wound. After its keeper falls, examine the opening."
msgstr "沿找到的线索去灰烬伤口。守护者倒下后，查看裂口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Examine the first apostle’s remains and read what you recover. The next trail has to begin with evidence."
msgstr "检查第一个使徒的遗骸，阅读找到的东西。下一条线索要从证据开始。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tend your wounds and prepare for the forest hollow. Rickert can help replace the hand; Godot can help with a blade. The hunt can wait until you can retreat safely."
msgstr "照料伤口，为森林洼地做准备。里凯尔特能帮你替换失去的手，格多能帮你准备刀剑。等你能安全撤退后再去狩猎。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Leave the threatened grove through the western path or southern garden. Keep moving until you are clear of the trees."
msgstr "沿西侧小路或南侧花园离开危险的树林，走到树木之外再停下。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Look at the current entry in my journal."
msgstr "查看日志中的当前记录。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The apostle’s hollow is marked on your map."
msgstr "使徒洼地已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The ashen breach is marked on your map."
msgstr "灰烬裂隙已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Count’s residence is marked on your map."
msgstr "伯爵的宅邸已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Black Dogs’ camp is marked on your map."
msgstr "黑犬营地已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The misty valley is marked on your map."
msgstr "迷雾山谷已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld’s stronghold is marked on your map."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Against creatures like those, such a blade may have work worthy of its weight. Still, a Dragonslayer is no promise that you will survive. Iron can endure what flesh cannot. Remember the difference."
msgstr "面对那些生物，这样的剑也许能找到配得上其重量的用途。但斩龙剑不能保证你活下来。铁能承受血肉无法承受的东西。记住这个区别。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You told me almost the whole Band was lost. I still do not know how. There was no roll call; I cannot give you a number. I keep remembering the voices that used to fill our camp."
msgstr "你告诉我几乎整个团都没了。我仍不知道原因。没有点名，我说不出人数。我总想起过去营地里的那些声音。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Come closer to the hearth, traveler. You may rest here and ask what you wish. Where shall we begin?"
msgstr "旅人，靠近炉火吧。你可以在这里休息，随意提问。我们从哪里开始？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What the closed breaches changed."
msgstr "封闭裂隙改变了什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why did the worlds collide?"
msgstr "为什么两个世界发生了碰撞？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "This house stands beside a spiritual tree. The crossing joined wounds in your world to paths in ours; the Eclipse deepened them. Quieting one wound helps those nearby, but cannot mend the whole boundary. That is why I guard this place and share what I can."
msgstr "这座房屋建在灵树旁。交汇把你们世界的伤口与我们世界的道路连接起来；蚀让它们更深。平息一道伤口能帮助附近的人，却无法修复整个边界。因此我守护这里，并尽力分享所知。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What should I do now?"
msgstr "我现在该做什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I have questions about the things I found."
msgstr "我想问问找到的东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We can begin with the wound you carry or with the paths between these worlds. Ask what you need to understand first."
msgstr "可以先谈你的伤口，也可以谈两个世界之间的道路。先问你最需要了解的事。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Can a smith help prepare my equipment?"
msgstr "铁匠能帮我准备装备吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Some trophies keep a little of the power that shaped their former master. One may help you strike a demon, another see through darkness or endure heat. Ask about a relic you actually carry; none promises safety on every road."
msgstr "有些战利品保留了塑造前任主人的一丝力量。它们或许能助你伤害恶魔、看穿黑暗，或忍耐高温。问问你真正携带的遗物吧；没有哪件能保证一路平安。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot and Rickert work at a woodland forge. They can help with a mechanical hand and a blade that must endure great strain. If you already own their work, ask for repairs rather than a second weapon."
msgstr "格多和里凯尔特在林间锻坊工作。他们能帮你制作机械手和承受强力冲击的刀剑。如果你已有他们的作品，就请他们修理，而不是再造一件。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tell me about the armor and its price."
msgstr "谈谈铠甲及其代价。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Who crosses the wounds?"
msgstr "谁会穿过这些伤口？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The frenzy can drive you for about two and a half minutes. Afterwards your strength and blood must recover; the price lasts much longer than the rush. The armor conceals pain, not the wound. Plan where to retreat before relying on it."
msgstr "狂暴能驱使你约两分半钟。之后力量与血液都需要恢复；代价远比冲动持久。铠甲掩盖疼痛，却不能抹去伤口。依赖它之前，先想好退路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "May I rest here and ask for help?"
msgstr "我可以在这里休息并请求帮助吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What does the Brand feel?"
msgstr "烙印会感知什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Collect the relic left at this known hunting ground. The wound there is already closed."
msgstr "去已知的狩猎地取回遗物。那里的伤口已经封闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The keeper on this known trail has fallen. Examine the wound it held open before leaving."
msgstr "这条已知线索上的守护者已倒下。离开前，查看它维持的伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The ashen keeper has fallen. Examine the wound and close it before following another trail."
msgstr "灰烬守护者已倒下。沿另一条线索走之前，查看并封闭伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The charm has already served its purpose. Keep the surviving directions in your journal."
msgstr "护符已经完成了使命。把幸存的指引留在日志里。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Collect the relic at the Count’s residence. The wound there is already closed."
msgstr "去伯爵的宅邸取回遗物。那里的伤口已经封闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The breach at the Count’s residence has lost its keeper. Examine the wound before leaving."
msgstr "伯爵的宅邸的裂隙已失去守护者。离开前，查看伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Collect the relic at the Black Dogs’ camp. The wound there is already closed."
msgstr "去黑犬营地取回遗物。那里的伤口已经封闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The breach at the Black Dogs’ camp has lost its keeper. Examine the wound before leaving."
msgstr "黑犬营地的裂隙已失去守护者。离开前，查看伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Collect the relic at the misty valley. The wound there is already closed."
msgstr "去迷雾山谷取回遗物。那里的伤口已经封闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The breach at the misty valley has lost its keeper. Examine the wound before leaving."
msgstr "迷雾山谷的裂隙已失去守护者。离开前，查看伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Collect the relic at Grunbeld’s stronghold. The wound there is already closed."
msgstr "去古伦贝鲁德的要塞取回遗物。那里的伤口已经封闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The breach at Grunbeld’s stronghold has lost its keeper. Examine the wound before leaving."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德的要塞的裂隙已失去守护者。离开前，查看伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The breaches recorded here are closed. Their surroundings have gained a respite, but the Brand endures and distant wounds remain open. Collect any relics left behind, tend your refuge and keep the surviving records. Beyond these quieted places lies country you have yet to explore."
msgstr "这里记录的裂隙已封闭。附近得到了喘息，但烙印仍在，远方的伤口也依然敞开。取回留下的遗物，照料你的庇护所，保存幸存的记录。在这些平静之地之外，还有尚未探索的世界。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "These directions are still incomplete. Follow the unfinished trails you already know and keep the records you recover."
msgstr "这些指引仍不完整。继续已知而未完成的道路，保存找到的记录。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Grunbeld has fallen, but the wound linked to his stronghold remains to be examined. Keep that unfinished trail in your journal."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德已倒下，但与其要塞相连的伤口仍需查看。这条未完成的线索已记在日志里。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The surviving directions point toward Grunbeld’s stronghold. Consult that entry when you are ready to continue."
msgstr "幸存的指引指向古伦贝鲁德的要塞。准备好继续时，查看那条记录。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The wound at Grunbeld’s stronghold is closed. Its unclaimed relic remains on your road."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁德要塞的伤口已封闭。未领取的遗物仍在你的道路上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I learn forging from Godot, but small moving parts are my favorite work. Locks, hinges, crossbows. Each piece can be sound on its own and still fail if it does not fit the next."
msgstr "我跟格多学习锻造，但最喜欢小巧的活动零件。锁、铰链、弩。每个零件都可能完好，但若彼此不合，整个机械还是会失灵。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot taught me to work the metal. I use that skill for crossbows, locks and fittings. A small part can save a life if it holds when it is needed."
msgstr "格多教会了我加工金属。我用这门手艺制作弩、锁和配件。小零件若能在关键时刻撑住，也能救人一命。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot taught me the metalwork. I can use it to build a hand with moving joints and a hidden cannon. The fittings must hold when you lean on it or fight."
msgstr "格多教会了我加工金属。我能造出带活动关节和隐藏火炮的义手。无论支撑身体还是战斗，配件都必须牢固。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We can discuss your arm cannon or crossbow bolts. Bring the materials to me at the forge when you have them."
msgstr "我们可以谈义肢炮或弩箭。收齐材料后，到锻坊交给我。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I can make crossbow bolts. We can go over what you need and what materials to bring to the forge."
msgstr "我能制作弩箭。我们可以讨论你需要什么，以及要带哪些材料到锻坊。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Mechanisms and craft."
msgstr "机械与手艺。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot makes blades. I build the mechanisms for your new hand. We can discuss the work, or just talk. What do you need?"
msgstr "格多打造刀剑。我为你的新手制作机械。我们可以谈工作，也可以聊聊。你需要什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot makes blades. I work on crossbows, locks and fastenings. We can discuss the work, or just talk. What do you need?"
msgstr "格多打造刀剑。我制作弩、锁和紧固件。我们可以谈工作，也可以聊聊。你需要什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I can help replace your hand. Godot can make a blade. But neither replaces a friend. Come to us when you are ready to work. We still have people to help."
msgstr "我能帮你替换失去的手，格多能打造刀剑。但这些都不能代替朋友。准备好工作时来找我们。还有人需要帮助。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot can help with a blade; I can work on your crossbow and its fittings. But weapons do not replace friends. There are still people we can help."
msgstr "格多能帮你打造刀剑，我能修整弩和配件。但武器不能代替朋友。还有人需要我们帮助。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Rickert has patient hands and an eye for moving parts. Let him show you his crossbow. I teach him to work the metal; he finds uses I would not have thought of."
msgstr "里凯尔特双手耐心，也看得懂活动零件。让他给你看看弩。我教他加工金属，他却能想到我没想过的用途。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We can talk about the crossbow, the forge, or another job you need done."
msgstr "我们可以谈弩、锻坊，或你需要的其他工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why did you help me?"
msgstr "为什么帮助我？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What is the Brand?"
msgstr "烙印是什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Behelit was a key to a place of sacrifice. The lives offered there were not a toll that bought your safety. You escaped because a way out was cut while you still lived. Do not seek another ceremony as a cure for what it left you."
msgstr "贝黑莱特是通往献祭之地的钥匙。那里献出的生命并不是为你买来安全的代价。你逃出，是因为在你还活着时，有人斩开了一条出口。不要寄望另一场仪式能治好它留下的伤。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What can I change?"
msgstr "我能改变什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why can you not close every wound?"
msgstr "为什么不能封闭所有伤口？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I follow a war older than your wounds. When I can deny the sacrifice another life, I do. That does not make your road mine to command. Keep the life I carried out of the dark; decide what is worth protecting with it."
msgstr "我追随一场比你的伤口更古老的战争。只要能从献祭中夺回一条生命，我就会去做。但你的路不由我支配。珍惜我从黑暗中带出的生命，决定有什么值得用它守护。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How does a ward help?"
msgstr "守护符印怎样帮助我？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What changes after a hunt?"
msgstr "狩猎之后会改变什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Not every demon follows your Brand. Some have crossed the wounds between worlds and roam on their own; the Brand draws another hunt toward you at night. Quieting its call does not remove creatures already near your bed. A closed wound does not silence the Brand."
msgstr "并非所有恶魔都追随你的烙印。有些从世界间的伤口越过，自行游荡；烙印则在夜里招来另一场狩猎。压低它的呼唤不会消除床边已有的生物，封闭一道伤口也不会令烙印沉默。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How should I approach a lair?"
msgstr "该怎样接近巢穴？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How do I keep track of the roads?"
msgstr "怎样记住已知的道路？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A keeper holds a particular wound open. When it falls, examine that wound; a victory alone may leave the opening behind. Closing it restrains new crossings nearby. Creatures that have already crossed remain, and distant wounds still feed the dark. Take the evidence with you and read it before choosing another road."
msgstr "守护者维持着某一道伤口。它倒下后，查看那道伤口；单靠胜利也许仍会留下裂口。封闭它能抑制附近的新穿越。已经过来的生物仍在，远方的伤口也继续滋养黑暗。带走证据，读过后再选择下一条路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How do I build the protective sign?"
msgstr "怎样建造守护符印？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Who can help with equipment?"
msgstr "谁能帮我准备装备？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Choose a place you can leave as well as defend. Dress your wounds, keep drinking water and bandages near your bed, and leave room to reach the door. Light helps you see what is coming; it is not a ward. Rest before testing your strength against an apostle. A weapon cannot give you back the breath spent running."
msgstr "选择一个既能守住、也能离开的地方。包扎伤口，在床边备好饮水和绷带，不要堵住通往门的路。光能帮你看清来者，却不能代替守护符印。挑战使徒前先休息，武器不能补回奔跑耗尽的体力。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Will it keep out every demon?"
msgstr "它能阻止所有恶魔吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Set eight stones and four bones into a protective sign on clear ground. A little wilderness knowledge is enough to arrange it; allow about twenty minutes. Keep your bed within eight steps on the same level. Walls and a clear escape route must do what the sign cannot: shelter you from creatures already here."
msgstr "在空地上用八块石头和四根骨头摆出守护符印。初步的野外生存知识就足够，大约需要二十分钟。床要在同一层、八格以内。墙壁和畅通的退路能弥补符印做不到的事：抵挡已经来到这里的生物。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tell me about the first hunt."
msgstr "谈谈初次狩猎。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What remains after the keeper falls?"
msgstr "守护者倒下后还剩什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Walk the outer ground first. Look for cover, lesser creatures and a way back before entering the keeper’s ground. Watch a heavy attack begin; move aside rather than trade blows through it. A retreat is not a broken oath. Return when your wounds and your equipment allow it, then examine what the fight uncovered."
msgstr "先查看外围。在进入守护者的领地前，找到掩体、小型敌人和退路。看清重击的起手，移开而不是硬换伤害。撤退不是背弃誓言。等伤势和装备允许再回来，然后检查战斗揭开的东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Open the journal."
msgstr "打开日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Let us consider the roads I know."
msgstr "谈谈我已知的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Keep one road journal for the directions you have learned, the smiths’ orders and the accounts you have read. Read a recovered letter before setting it aside; a sealed page has told you nothing. If a road is uncertain, keep its entry and return to the evidence. When we part, those notes will remain with you."
msgstr "用一本旅行日志保存已学到的方向、铁匠的委托和读过的记述。放下找到的信之前先读它；未展开的纸页还没有告诉你任何事。道路不明确时，留下记录，再回到证据。我们分别后，这些笔记仍会陪着你。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What did the Behelit do?"
msgstr "贝黑莱特做了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why does the Brand call to them?"
msgstr "为什么烙印呼唤它们？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What changed when the worlds collided?"
msgstr "世界碰撞改变了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Does every demon follow the Brand?"
msgstr "所有恶魔都追随烙印吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What can closing a wound change?"
msgstr "封闭伤口能改变什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Does every demon follow it?"
msgstr "所有恶魔都追随它吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A sign of stone and bone quiets the Brand’s new night summons within eight tiles on the same level. It does not stop roaming demons, zombies or attacks. Place your bed within its reach; prepare water, light and an escape route. The sign needs no fuel, but its protection ends when you leave its reach."
msgstr "石与骨的符印会压低同一层八格内烙印招来的新夜间召唤。它不能阻止游荡的恶魔、僵尸或攻击。把床放在范围内，备好水、光和退路。符印不需要燃料，但离开范围就失去保护。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How do I build it?"
msgstr "怎样建造它？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What else should I prepare?"
msgstr "还该准备什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Which dangers remain?"
msgstr "还剩哪些危险？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "How do I prepare a refuge?"
msgstr "怎样准备庇护所？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What should I prepare before leaving?"
msgstr "出发前该准备什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What did the Eclipse do to my body?"
msgstr "蚀对我的身体做了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Who can make a prosthetic and a weapon?"
msgstr "谁能制作义肢和武器？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Who can help with a weapon?"
msgstr "谁能帮我准备武器？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The smiths can help you prepare a blade and mend your equipment."
msgstr "铁匠们能帮你准备刀剑，修整装备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tend the wounds you carry before returning to the hunt. Rest and dressings matter as much as the next weapon."
msgstr "重返狩猎前，先照料伤口。休息与包扎和下一件武器一样重要。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You are missing your left hand and an eye. The grip and sight you relied on have changed. Rickert can help with the hand; neither he nor a blade can replace the lost eye. Rest before asking your body for another battle."
msgstr "你失去了左手和一只眼。原有的抓握与视野已改变。里凯尔特能帮你替换手，但他和新剑都不能还你失去的眼睛。再次战斗前先休息。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Your left hand is missing. Rickert can help you replace it. Give your other wounds time to recover before returning to the hunt."
msgstr "你失去了左手。里凯尔特能帮你替换它。重返狩猎前，给其他伤口留些恢复时间。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You escaped the Eclipse. What follows is yours to decide. Ask what you need to know before I ride on."
msgstr "你逃出了蚀。接下来的路由你决定。在我骑马离去前，问你需要知道的事。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Godot keeps a woodland forge with Rickert beside him. The old master makes blades; his apprentice works on mechanisms and crossbows. Bring useful metal rather than promises. If you already carry their work, ask for repairs. These directions will remain in your notes after we part."
msgstr "格多与里凯尔特在林间锻坊工作。老匠人打造刀剑，学徒制作机械与弩。带来有用的金属而非承诺。已有他们的作品，就请他们修理。分别后，这些指引仍会留在笔记里。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Tend your wounds and prepare armor, dressings and a way back before the forest hollow. Godot can help with a blade. The hunt can wait until you can retreat safely."
msgstr "去森林洼地之前，先照料伤口，备好护甲、绷带和退路。格多能帮你准备刀剑。等你能安全撤退后再狩猎。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why did you save me, and where will you go?"
msgstr "为什么救我，你又要去哪里？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "When we part, I ride on. Ask now about the Brand, shelter, the smiths or the roads you know. I will not be waiting here when you return. The directions and advice you have written in your road journal will remain with you."
msgstr "分别之后，我就会骑马离去。现在可以问烙印、庇护所、铁匠和已知的道路。等你回来时，我不会还在这里。写进旅行日志的指引和建议仍会陪着你。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Eclipse and escape."
msgstr "蚀与逃生。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What the Behelit opened."
msgstr "贝黑莱特打开了什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The different dangers."
msgstr "不同的危险。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Protection and its limits."
msgstr "保护及其局限。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Building a protective sign."
msgstr "建造守护符印。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Preparing for the road."
msgstr "旅途准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Approaching a lair."
msgstr "接近巢穴。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What a closed wound changes."
msgstr "封闭伤口改变什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The collision of worlds."
msgstr "世界碰撞。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Apostles and the God Hand."
msgstr "使徒与神之手。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The defeated reflection."
msgstr "被击破的倒影。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Help with the missing hand."
msgstr "替换失去的手。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Fitting the arm cannon."
msgstr "安装义肢炮。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Keeping the roads together."
msgstr "保存道路记录。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Knight’s own road."
msgstr "骑士自己的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Advice you wrote down while speaking with the Skull Knight."
msgstr "与骷髅骑士交谈时记下的建议。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Words of the Skull Knight."
msgstr "骷髅骑士的话。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Brand and night summons."
msgstr "烙印与夜间召唤。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge is marked on your map. The direction is kept in your road journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊已标在地图上。方向已记在旅行日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge’s road is still uncertain. The account is saved in your road journal; return to it when you have more bearings."
msgstr "通往林间锻坊的道路仍不明确。记述已保存在旅行日志中；有更多方位线索后再查看它。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Find the woodland forge"
msgstr "寻找林间锻坊"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Find the woodland forge and speak with one of its masters. The smith repairs weapons and forges heavy blades; his young companion works on crossbows. Their help may make the next journey easier."
msgstr "找到林间锻坊，与其中一位工匠交谈。铁匠修理武器、锻造重剑，年轻的助手制作弩。他们的帮助能让下一段旅程轻松些。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*The hammer keeps its rhythm. \"What do you want? This is a forge, not an inn. If you need work done, show me the iron.\""
msgstr "*锤声没有停下。“要什么？这是锻坊，不是旅店。需要干活，就把铁拿给我看。”"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Back again? Good. Tell me what the road did to your equipment."
msgstr "又回来了？好。说说旅途把你的装备折腾成什么样了。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "That armored rider brought you in. I am Godot; the boy is Rickert. Sit while your legs still shake. Work can wait until you can tell me what you need."
msgstr "那个披甲骑士把你带了过来。我是格多，孩子叫里凯尔特。腿还发抖就坐着。等你能说清需要什么，再谈工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts. Still alive, then. Sit down and show me what needs mending."
msgstr "格斯。看来还活着。坐下，让我看看有什么要修。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Oh, hello! I am Rickert. I was checking the lock on my crossbow. Are you looking for Godot, or can I help you?"
msgstr "哦，你好！我是里凯尔特。刚才在检查弩的机括。你找格多，还是需要我帮忙？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Good to see you again. The crossbow still needs work, but I can put it aside. Have you brought materials, or come to talk?"
msgstr "很高兴又见到你。弩还没弄好，不过我可以先放下。你带来了材料，还是想聊聊？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You are awake. Take it slowly. The armored rider brought you here barely alive. I am Rickert; this is Godot’s forge. We dressed your wounds. We can talk when you feel able."
msgstr "你醒了。慢慢来。披甲骑士把你带来时，你几乎没了气。我是里凯尔特，这里是格多的锻坊。我们包扎了你的伤口。等你能说话时，再聊聊。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You are awake! I recognized you when the rider brought you in, but you could barely breathe. We dressed your wounds. Tell me what happened when you can."
msgstr "你醒了！骑士把你带来时我认出了你，可你几乎无法呼吸。我们包扎了伤口。能说话时，告诉我发生了什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts! You are awake at last. The Skull Knight brought you barely alive. We tended your wounds. Where are Judeau, Pippin, Corkus? What happened to the Band?"
msgstr "格斯！谢天谢地，你醒了。骷髅骑士把你带来时，你几乎没了气。我们照料了你的伤口。捷度、比宾、哥尔卡斯在哪里？鹰之团出了什么事？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts. It is good to see you again. We can talk, or I can work on the mechanism. What do you need?"
msgstr "格斯。很高兴你回来了。我们可以聊聊，也可以修整机械。你需要什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts! Good to see you. I am working on this crossbow; the lock keeps catching. Godot is grumbling as usual. Have you brought your blade, or just come to see us?"
msgstr "格斯！你回来了！我在弄这把弩，机括总卡住。格多还是老样子，老在嘟囔。你带了剑，还是只是来看我们？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The wheel broke before dusk. We left the iron fittings under the bound box and carried the grain away. A repair order is tucked between the pages: \"Take the bent blades to Godot’s woodland forge. He works with a young crossbow maker. Keep to the old cart tracks through the woods.\" The margins record bends and stream crossings."
msgstr "天黑前车轮断了。我们把铁配件留在包铁的箱子下，带走了谷物。纸页间夹着一份修理订单：“把弯剑送到格多的林间锻坊。一个年轻的制弩师跟他一起工作。沿树林中的旧车辙走。”页边记着转弯与渡溪的位置。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Look up the woodland forge in my journal."
msgstr "查看日志中的林间锻坊。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "We leave before the next dusk. The water is clean; whoever follows may need the blanket more than we do. The smith Godot repaired our broken blade at his woodland forge. His young helper makes crossbow bolts. We copied the way back here: the old track, the stream crossing, then the charcoal burners’ path. It is a long walk, but there is a master at its end."
msgstr "我们在下一次天黑前离开。水是干净的；后来者也许比我们更需要毯子。铁匠格多在林间锻坊修好了我们的断剑，他的年轻助手制作弩箭。我们抄下了回去的路：旧小径、渡溪处，然后是烧炭人的路。走得远，但尽头有一位大师。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Water was stored in the east room; blankets and dressings in the sacristy. An earlier entry records a traveler who brought a repaired sword and bolts: \"Godot’s forge is still working in the woods. The old man and his young helper take useful metal for their work.\" He drew the road on the back of the page. Later entries stop counting meals and count hours beside the red stone. The last volunteer wrote: \"This was meant to be a shelter.\""
msgstr "水存放在东屋，毯子和绷带放在圣器室。早先一条记录提到带来修好的剑和弩箭的旅人：“格多的锻坊仍在林中工作。老人和年轻助手接受可用的金属作为报酬。”他在纸背画了道路。后来不再数饭食，而是数红石旁度过的小时。最后一位志愿者写道：“这里本该是庇护所。”"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead."
msgstr "林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: review your orders, ask about repairs or prepare for another journey.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：查看委托、询问修理，或准备下一段旅程。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: review your orders, ask about repairs or prepare for another journey.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：查看委托、询问修理，或准备下一段旅程。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: meet Rickert, the young craftsman working beside Godot.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：结识与格多一起工作的年轻工匠里凯尔特。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: meet Rickert, the young craftsman working beside Godot.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：结识与格多一起工作的年轻工匠里凯尔特。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: speak with Godot, the master of the forge.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：与锻坊主人格多交谈。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: speak with Godot, the master of the forge.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：与锻坊主人格多交谈。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: introduce yourself to the people who live here.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：向锻坊的居民介绍自己。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: introduce yourself to the people who live here.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：向锻坊的居民介绍自己。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nA woodland smith takes on damaged weapons that other craftsmen abandon. A young crossbow maker works beside him. The road may be long, but their help could prepare you for what lies ahead.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n林间铁匠会接手其他工匠放弃的损坏武器。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。道路也许很长，但他们的帮助能为接下来的旅途做好准备。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*Most of the wagon has been stripped. A repair order lies under the lid of the iron-bound box. One dry bundle remains beneath it. You could recover the provisions or break the box for its fittings."
msgstr "*马车几乎被洗劫一空。铁箍箱盖下放着一张武器修理订单，下面还有一个干燥包裹。你可以取出补给，或拆箱回收铁件。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*The wagon box has been searched. The repair order is still tucked beneath its lid."
msgstr "*马车箱已被搜过。修理订单仍夹在箱盖下面。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Read the weapon repair order."
msgstr "阅读武器修理订单。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*The travelers left a dry windbreak and their last blanket. A water skin and a folded message lie beside it. You can prepare a bed here or take the blanket for the road."
msgstr "*旅人留下了干燥的挡风棚和最后一条毯子，旁边有水囊和折好的留言。你可以在这里铺床，或带走毯子。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "*The bedding and supplies have already been sorted. The traveler’s message remains beside the cold ashes."
msgstr "*寝具和补给已经整理过。旅人的留言仍在冷灰旁。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Read the traveler’s message."
msgstr "阅读旅人的留言。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: review your orders, ask about repairs or prepare for another journey.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：查看委托、询问修理，或准备下一段旅程。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: review your orders, ask about repairs or prepare for another journey.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：查看委托、询问修理，或准备下一段旅程。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: meet Rickert, the young craftsman working beside Godot.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：结识与格多一起工作的年轻工匠里凯尔特。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: meet Rickert, the young craftsman working beside Godot.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：结识与格多一起工作的年轻工匠里凯尔特。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: speak with Godot, the master of the forge.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：与锻坊主人格多交谈。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: speak with Godot, the master of the forge.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：与锻坊主人格多交谈。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: introduce yourself to the people who live here.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：向锻坊的居民介绍自己。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: introduce yourself to the people who live here.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：向锻坊的居民介绍自己。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: marked on the map."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点：已标在地图上。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The woodland forge\n\nKnown: a woodland smith repairs weapons and makes heavy blades. A young crossbow maker works with him.\n\nNow: reach the woodland forge and meet its masters.\n\nWhy: prepare your equipment for further journeys.\n\nPlace: not yet located. The account is kept in the journal."
msgstr "林间锻坊\n\n已知：林间铁匠修理武器、打造重剑。一位年轻的制弩师与他一起工作。\n\n当前：抵达林间锻坊并结识工匠。\n\n目的：为接下来的旅途准备装备。\n\n地点尚未确定。记述已保存在日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Your wounds have been dressed. You may rest in the west part of the loft. The Skull Knight waits outside the western door and wants to speak before he leaves."
msgstr "你的伤口已包扎好。你可以在阁楼西侧休息。骷髅骑士在西门外等候，想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts, you recognize the smell of coal and Godot’s hammer below. You are back at the forge, but the memory of the red sky will not leave you."
msgstr "格斯，你认出了煤炭的气味和楼下格多的锤声。你回到了锻坊，可红色天空的记忆仍挥之不去。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You open your eyes in the forge you visited before. The beams, coal dust and sound of work are familiar. Someone has set your equipment beside you."
msgstr "你在曾经来过的锻坊睁开双眼。梁木、煤尘和工作的声音都很熟悉。有人把你的装备放在了身旁。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The hammer below and the woodland outside the window bring back the directions you read. This must be the forge you were looking for. You have reached it in a way you never intended."
msgstr "楼下的锤声和窗外的树林让你想起读过的路引。这一定是你寻找的锻坊。你抵达这里的方式，却完全出乎意料。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You awaken in an unfamiliar wooden house. From below come the sound of a hammer and the warmth of a forge. You do not yet know whose home this is, but someone has kept you alive."
msgstr "你在陌生的木屋中醒来。楼下传来锤声和炉火的热气。你还不知道这是谁的家，但有人保住了你的命。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts, you recognize the smell of coal and Godot’s hammer below. You are back at the forge, but the memory of the red sky will not leave you.\n\nYour wounds have been dressed. You may rest in the west part of the loft. The Skull Knight waits outside the western door and wants to speak before he leaves."
msgstr "格斯，你认出了煤炭的气味和楼下格多的锤声。你回到了锻坊，可红色天空的记忆仍挥之不去。\n\n你的伤口已包扎好。你可以在阁楼西侧休息。骷髅骑士在西门外等候，想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You open your eyes in the forge you visited before. The beams, coal dust and sound of work are familiar. Someone has set your equipment beside you.\n\nYour wounds have been dressed. You may rest in the west part of the loft. The Skull Knight waits outside the western door and wants to speak before he leaves."
msgstr "你在曾经来过的锻坊睁开双眼。梁木、煤尘和工作的声音都很熟悉。有人把你的装备放在了身旁。\n\n你的伤口已包扎好。你可以在阁楼西侧休息。骷髅骑士在西门外等候，想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The hammer below and the woodland outside the window bring back the directions you read. This must be the forge you were looking for. You have reached it in a way you never intended.\n\nYour wounds have been dressed. You may rest in the west part of the loft. The Skull Knight waits outside the western door and wants to speak before he leaves."
msgstr "楼下的锤声和窗外的树林让你想起读过的路引。这一定是你寻找的锻坊。你抵达这里的方式，却完全出乎意料。\n\n你的伤口已包扎好。你可以在阁楼西侧休息。骷髅骑士在西门外等候，想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You awaken in an unfamiliar wooden house. From below come the sound of a hammer and the warmth of a forge. You do not yet know whose home this is, but someone has kept you alive.\n\nYour wounds have been dressed. You may rest in the west part of the loft. The Skull Knight waits outside the western door and wants to speak before he leaves."
msgstr "你在陌生的木屋中醒来。楼下传来锤声和炉火的热气。你还不知道这是谁的家，但有人保住了你的命。\n\n你的伤口已包扎好。你可以在阁楼西侧休息。骷髅骑士在西门外等候，想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts. You are awake. Sit down; the iron can wait. Rickert and I have done what we could for your wounds."
msgstr "格斯。你醒了。坐下，铁器可以等。我和里凯尔特已尽力照料你的伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You frightened us when the rider brought you back. You are under my roof now. Rest first; tell me about the work when you can."
msgstr "骑士把你带回来时，可把我们吓坏了。现在你在我的屋檐下。先休息，能说话时再谈工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The armored rider brought you in. I am Godot; Rickert helped me dress your wounds. Rest before asking what the forge can do for you."
msgstr "披甲骑士把你带来了。我是格多，里凯尔特帮我包扎了你的伤口。先休息，再问锻坊能帮什么忙。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts. Good to see you on your feet. We can talk about the Band, the crossbow, or the work you need done."
msgstr "格斯。很高兴你能站起来。我们可以谈鹰之团、弩，或你需要的工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "What would you like to ask?"
msgstr "你想问些什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Could you help me replace my hand?"
msgstr "你能帮我替换失去的手吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Could you make bolts for a crossbow?"
msgstr "你能制作弩箭吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "May I rest here before going on?"
msgstr "我能在出发前在这里休息吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I would like to ask a few other things."
msgstr "我还想问些别的。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I will let you work."
msgstr "我不打扰你工作了。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A good smith? You found the best. I am Godot. If a blade is worth saving, put it where I can see it. If you need a new one, we will talk about the metal first."
msgstr "好铁匠？你找到了最好的。我是格多。刀剑若还值得救，就拿来看看。要新剑的话，先谈金属。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Let me show you the blade."
msgstr "让我给你看看刀剑。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I have a few questions."
msgstr "我有些问题。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "May I rest here?"
msgstr "我能在这里休息吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Use the west part of the loft, upstairs by the window. The straw bed and blanket may stay yours for the night. There is a little food and clean dressing cloth if you need it. Leave the forge tools and the other stores alone."
msgstr "用阁楼西侧靠窗的位置吧。今晚可以睡草床、盖毯子。需要的话，我给你一点食物和干净包扎布。别动锻造工具和其他储物。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "A little food and dressing cloth would help."
msgstr "一点食物和包扎布会有帮助。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Thank you. I know where to rest."
msgstr "谢谢，我知道在哪休息了。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Go upstairs and use the bed by the west window. You may rest with the blanket there. I can spare a little food and dressing cloth. The other room and the tools belong to the household; ask before taking anything else."
msgstr "上楼，用西窗旁的床吧，毯子也在那里。我可以给你一点食物和包扎布。另一间房和工具是我们的；拿其他东西前先问问。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I mend my own heavy blades: the long battle sword and the Dragon Slayer. For a damaged piece, bring one steel lump and 50 charcoal. We can go over the materials even if you do not have them yet."
msgstr "我修理自己打造的重剑：长战剑和斩龙剑。修理损坏的刀剑需要一块钢和50份木炭。还没有材料，也可以先问清。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I mend the heavy blades I forge. Bring one steel lump and 50 charcoal for a damaged piece. If yours is still sound, keep your metal; we can discuss a new blade without starting the work today."
msgstr "我修理自己锻造的重剑。损坏的刀剑需要一块钢和50份木炭。你的剑若还完好，就留着金属吧。今天不下单，也可以谈新剑。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Guts. You are awake. Sit down; the iron can wait. I have done what I could for your wounds."
msgstr "格斯。你醒了。坐下，铁器可以等。我已尽力照料你的伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You frightened me when the rider brought you back. You are under my roof now. Rest first; tell me about the work when you can."
msgstr "骑士把你带回来时，可把我吓坏了。现在你在我的屋檐下。先休息，能说话时再谈工作。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The armored rider brought you in. I am Godot. Give your wounds time to settle. Rest before asking what the forge can do for you."
msgstr "披甲骑士把你带来了。我是格多。让伤口先缓一缓。休息过后，再问锻坊能帮什么忙。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Skull Knight shields you while he searches for a way out. The passage has not closed."
msgstr "骷髅骑士护住你，寻找出路。通道仍未关闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Skull Knight waits outside the door. He wanted to speak with you before leaving."
msgstr "骷髅骑士在门外等候。他想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The Skull Knight waits nearby. He wanted to speak with you before leaving."
msgstr "骷髅骑士在附近等候。他想在离开前与你交谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Fire or poison had reached the forge. I would not leave you there. This place will give you room to breathe. I cannot tell you what became of its people; keep the road you know, and judge it when you can."
msgstr "火焰或毒气已侵入锻坊。我不能把你留在那里。这里至少能让你喘口气。我不知道那里的人怎样了。记住你知道的路，能去时再判断。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I could not find a safe place for you inside the forge. I brought you out here instead. That does not tell us what became of its masters. The road is still known; return when you are able, and see what remains."
msgstr "我在锻坊里找不到能安全安置你的地方，所以把你带到了这里。这不能说明工匠们的命运。道路仍然已知；等你能行动时，回去看看留下了什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "I could not reach the woodland forge with you in time. Getting you out came first. There are masters who may still help you. Ask about the road before I leave; the account will remain in your journal."
msgstr "我没能及时带你抵达林间锻坊。先把你救出来更要紧。仍有工匠可能帮你。趁我离开前问问道路；记录会留在你的日志中。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Why did you not take me to the forge?"
msgstr "为什么没有把我带到锻坊？"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Return to the Skull Knight."
msgstr "返回骷髅骑士的对话。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "View the trail to the Ashen Breach."
msgstr "查看通往灰烬裂隙的线索。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The apostle is dead. Search its remains: a burned scrap among them may explain where it came from."
msgstr "使徒已死。搜查它的遗骸：其中的烧焦纸片也许能说明它来自何处。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Scarred living ground stretches beneath the Eclipse. A dull glow seeps through it, outlining the field between brighter veins."
msgstr "满布伤痕的活体地面在蚀之下延伸。暗淡的光从中渗出，勾勒出明亮血管之间的原野。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "You may use the bench and anvil. Bring me your blade if it needs straightening; Rickert knows the tools and fittings. There is a place to rest upstairs. Ask before taking our supplies."
msgstr "你可以使用工作台和铁砧。刀剑需要矫直就拿来给我；里凯尔特熟悉工具和配件。楼上有地方休息。取用我们的补给前，先问一声。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Hooked arms tear across the bare ground!"
msgstr "钩状手臂撕过裸露的地面！"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Hollow apostle: raise hooks"
msgstr "洼地使徒：举起钩爪"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The apostle raises its hooked arms before sweeping the ground."
msgstr "使徒举起钩状手臂，准备横扫地面。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Ground beneath raised hooks"
msgstr "钩爪下的地面"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The threatened ground shows where the apostle’s hooks will sweep."
msgstr "受威胁的地面显示使徒钩爪将要横扫的位置。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Hollow apostle: hook sweep"
msgstr "洼地使徒：钩爪横扫"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Hooked arms strike the ground in front of the apostle."
msgstr "钩状手臂砸向使徒前方的地面。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "ground threatened by hooked arms"
msgstr "钩状手臂威胁的地面"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "Raising hooked arms"
msgstr "举起钩状手臂"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The apostle braces itself. Its raised hooks will strike the marked ground in two seconds."
msgstr "使徒稳住身体。两秒后，举起的钩爪将击中标出的地面。"

#. New Horizon 3.2: road journal
msgid "The hollow’s apostle digs in and raises its hooks. The ground before it is about to be swept!"
msgstr "洼地使徒稳住身体，举起钩爪。它即将横扫前方的地面！"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "distorted Behelit"
msgstr "扭曲的贝黑莱特"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "Blood has soaked into the stone without leaving a stain. Its features now seem to watch you. In the silence you almost hear a whisper: \"How long will you let others choose your fate? Come, and decide what you will become.\""
msgstr "血渗入了石头，却没有留下污迹。它的面孔似乎正注视着你。寂静中，你几乎能听见低语：‘你还要让别人决定你的命运多久？来吧，决定你将成为什么。’"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "Listen to the call"
msgstr "聆听呼唤"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "drench a Behelit in blood"
msgstr "用血浸透贝黑莱特"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "The stone seems to call to you: \"You need not remain powerless.\" Cover its face in blood and wait until the last drop disappears. Something may answer from the other side."
msgstr "石头似乎在呼唤你：‘你不必继续无能为力。’用血覆盖它的面孔，等待最后一滴消失。另一侧也许会有什么回应。"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "The face does not change. You recover the stone and the blood."
msgstr "面孔没有变化。你取回石头和血液。"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "The blood-darkened face stirs. A distant voice calls your name, but no passage opens."
msgstr "被血染暗的面孔动了。遥远的声音呼唤你的名字，但通道没有打开。"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "The blood-darkened face remains silent."
msgstr "被血染暗的面孔沉默不语。"

#. New Horizon 3.3 D1: apostle path
msgid "The stone no longer answers your call."
msgstr "石头不再回应你的呼唤。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Current objective: live through the changing flesh. Find food and a place to rest; your new abilities will emerge over the next few days."
msgstr "*当前目标：熬过肉体的变化。寻找食物和休息之处；新的能力将在接下来的几天里显现。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Five presences watch from beyond the ring. A voice seems to rise inside your chest. “You followed the call. You may return as you were, or let your flesh become the instrument of your own will.”"
msgstr "*五道身影在圆环之外注视着你。一个声音仿佛从你的胸中响起。「你追随召唤而来。你可以保持原样归去，也可以让肉体成为自身意志的工具。」"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Slan’s gift is still changing your body. Over the next few days your senses will sharpen, your flesh will learn another shape, and its new abilities will emerge. Rest, find food and watch what changes. You need no further dose."
msgstr "*斯兰的赐予仍在改变你的身体。接下来的几天里，感官将变得敏锐，肉体会学会另一种形态，新的能力也会出现。休息，寻找食物，留意变化。不需要再次接受赐予。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The change is complete. Your night senses, fighting shape, tendril and ability to mend flesh are now yours. Use the mutations menu to call on them. Food, stamina and recovery still limit their use."
msgstr "*变化已经完成。夜间感官、战斗形态、触须和修复肉体的能力都已属于你。通过突变菜单使用它们。食物、体力和恢复时间仍会限制其使用。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The field disappears. You see fragments of your life: doors that stayed shut, hands you could not hold, mornings survived without knowing why. The vision presses them together until every kindness seems small and every effort wasted. It offers one conclusion: a worthless life. Yet these are your memories, bent by something that wants your answer."
msgstr "*原野消失了。你看见生命的碎片：始终紧闭的门，没能握住的手，不知为何仍然熬到的清晨。幻象将它们挤在一起，直到每一份善意都显得渺小，每一次努力都像是徒劳。它只给出一个结论：毫无价值的一生。然而，这些是你的记忆，被某个渴望得到你回答的存在扭曲了。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The memories recede. “There is still time. Accept, and your flesh will learn to bear what has touched it. Leave as a human, and some part of that flesh will fail. Hearing. Sight. The steadiness of your hands, if those are already lost. You will carry one wound beyond this place. Is this still your answer?”"
msgstr "*记忆退去了。「还来得及。接受赐予，你的肉体就会学会承受触碰过它的力量。以人类之身离去，肉体的一部分将会衰败。听觉。视觉。如果这两者早已失去，那便是双手的稳定。你将带着一道伤痕离开这里。你的回答仍然不变吗？」"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The transformation is complete. Prepare your new strength, then choose among the roads you already know."
msgstr "*转化已经完成。熟悉新的力量，然后从已知的道路中作出选择。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You returned from the ceremony human. Recover, examine the wound it left and decide which known road to follow."
msgstr "*你以人类之身从仪式中归来。恢复身体，了解仪式留下的伤痕，再决定走向哪条已知的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You returned human. The scar left by the ceremony is permanent; it grants no demonic strength."
msgstr "*你仍是人类。仪式留下的伤痕是永久的；它不会赋予恶魔的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*“Human flesh is a frail vessel. Accept the gift and it will change, slowly, until the shape you knew is only one shape among others. The choice cannot be undone. Refuse, and this passage will still leave a wound: your hearing or your sight may fail you. No human body crosses this place untouched.”"
msgstr "*「人的肉体是脆弱的容器。接受赐予，它会缓慢改变，直到你熟悉的模样只是众多形态之一。这个选择无法撤销。拒绝，这次穿越仍会留下伤痕：你的听觉或视觉可能衰退。没有人类的身体能毫发无伤地经过此地。」"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A black, falcon-shaped presence stands apart from the others. The distance to it seems greater than the field itself."
msgstr "一道黑色猎鹰般的身影独立于其他身影之外。它与你的距离仿佛比整片原野还要遥远。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A cutting tendril lashes a nearby enemy."
msgstr "一条锋利的触须抽向附近的敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A dark, winged figure rises above the ceremony. Her voice seems to reach you through your own blood."
msgstr "一道黑暗的有翼身影俯视着仪式。她的声音仿佛通过你自己的血液传来。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A second pulse beats beneath your skin. You accepted Slan’s gift; the change has only begun."
msgstr "第二道脉搏在你的皮肤下跳动。你接受了斯兰的赐予；变化才刚刚开始。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A small floating figure peers through round lenses. Around it, memories take shapes they never had."
msgstr "一个漂浮的小小身影透过圆形镜片窥视着你。它周围的记忆化为从未有过的模样。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A squat, silent presence stands among the folds of flesh. The air around it feels heavy and sick."
msgstr "一个矮胖而沉默的身影立在肉体的褶皱之间。它周围的空气沉重而病态。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A towering figure with an exposed brain watches from beyond the living wall. Its stillness is more terrible than movement."
msgstr "一个脑部裸露的高大身影从活墙之外注视着你。它的静止比任何动作都更加可怕。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "An impulse travels down your arm. A cord of living flesh snaps outward, then draws back beneath your skin."
msgstr "一道冲动沿手臂传来。一束活生生的血肉猛然抽出，随后缩回皮肤之下。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle of the crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉的使徒"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Back to my current objective."
msgstr "返回当前目标。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beyond the luminous circle, five presences wait for an answer. The path behind you has vanished."
msgstr "发光的圆环之外，五道身影正等待你的回答。身后的道路已经消失。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Conrad"
msgstr "康拉德"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Echo of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀的回声"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Eclipse: the calling"
msgstr "蚀：召唤"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Femto"
msgstr "费蒙特"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Follow the voice beyond the world? Take what you need now: the passage will close behind you."
msgstr "追随声音前往世界之外吗？现在就带上所需之物：通道将在你身后关闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accept. Give me the strength to become something else."
msgstr "我接受。给我成为另一种存在的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I need to think."
msgstr "我需要想一想。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I will remain human."
msgstr "我要保持人类之身。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your unfolded form, restore up to 6 HP to each major body part. Costs 1200 stamina, 60 kcal and 6 seconds; recovers in 10 minutes. It cannot restore a missing hand or eye."
msgstr "在展开的形态下，为每个主要身体部位恢复最多6点生命值。消耗1200体力、60千卡和6秒；10分钟后可再次使用。无法恢复失去的手或眼睛。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your unfolded form, strike a visible enemy up to 3 tiles away with a cutting tendril. Costs 800 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 15 seconds."
msgstr "在展开的形态下，用锋利的触须攻击3格以内可见的敌人。消耗800体力和1秒；15秒后可再次使用。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lash of the crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉之鞭"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let your flesh unfold into a fighting shape: +4 strength, +1 dexterity, +15% melee damage and 4 points of natural protection. It costs 2 kcal each minute. Changing shape takes 2 seconds and does not heal wounds."
msgstr "让肉体展开为战斗形态：力量+4、敏捷+1、近战伤害+15%，并获得4点天然防护。每分钟消耗2千卡。变形需要2秒，不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Look back toward the circle."
msgstr "重新望向圆环。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Mend the crimson flesh"
msgstr "修复绯红血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Movement is clearer in the dark. Your night vision reaches 2 tiles farther."
msgstr "黑暗中的动作变得更加清晰。你的夜视距离增加2格。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pale cords converge inside a ring of living light. Five figures watch beyond its edge. Their voices fall silent, waiting for your answer."
msgstr "苍白的筋束汇聚在活光构成的圆环之内。五道身影在边缘之外注视着你。它们的声音归于沉寂，等待你的回答。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed of the crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉之种"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses of the crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉的感官"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Slan"
msgstr "斯兰"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The circle is silent."
msgstr "圆环沉默无声。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The field quiets ahead. Beyond the luminous ring, five shapes are waiting for you."
msgstr "前方的原野安静了下来。发光的圆环之外，五道身影正在等你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The folds draw together. Your body takes its familiar shape."
msgstr "褶皱合拢，你的身体恢复了熟悉的模样。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The passage closes. A pale trail crosses the living field; beyond it, five distant shapes wait in a ring of light."
msgstr "通道关闭了。一条苍白的小径穿过活生生的原野；远处，五道身影在光环中等待着你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The second pulse settles into your heartbeat. Your new flesh has finished growing; now its strength is yours to spend."
msgstr "第二道脉搏融入你的心跳。新的肉体已停止生长；现在，你可以支配它的力量了。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The torn flesh draws together. Hunger follows the relief."
msgstr "撕裂的血肉重新合拢。缓解之后，饥饿随之而来。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The voice fades. The stone remains in your hand."
msgstr "声音消退，石头仍留在你的手中。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The way back will not hold. Your answer has been heard; touch the circle again to seek another opening."
msgstr "返回的通道无法维持。你的回答已被听见；再次触碰圆环，寻找另一个出口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Tremor of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀之颤抖"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Ubik"
msgstr "尤比克"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold the crimson flesh"
msgstr "展开绯红血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Veil of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀之帷幕"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Void"
msgstr "波伊德"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What has changed in me?"
msgstr "我发生了什么变化？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What is the price?"
msgstr "代价是什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Yes. Return me human, whatever remains of me."
msgstr "是的。无论还剩下什么，让我以人类之身归去。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You are an apostle shaped by Slan’s gift. Your transformation is complete. Its abilities consume your strength; the change will grow no further."
msgstr "你是由斯兰的赐予塑造的使徒。转化已经完成。能力会消耗你的力量；肉体不会继续变化。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You cannot lash out now. Let your flesh unfold, and wait until your strength returns."
msgstr "现在还无法挥出触须。让肉体展开，并等待力量恢复。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You left the ceremony human, but distant shapes blur together. Corrective glasses can compensate for your damaged sight."
msgstr "你以人类之身离开仪式，但远处的轮廓变得模糊。矫正眼镜可以补偿受损的视力。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You left the ceremony human, but its silence followed you. Sounds reach you at half their former strength."
msgstr "你以人类之身离开仪式，但它的寂静跟随你而来。传到你耳中的声音只有从前的一半强。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You left the ceremony human, but your hands retain a faint tremor. Your dexterity is reduced by 1."
msgstr "你以人类之身离开仪式，但双手留下了轻微的颤抖。敏捷降低1点。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You return human. The voices are gone, but something they touched has not returned with you."
msgstr "你仍是人类。那些声音消失了，但它们触碰过的一部分没有随你归来。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You wake where the world first opened. Beneath your skin, a second pulse answers your own. The gift has begun to take root."
msgstr "你在世界最初裂开的地方醒来。皮肤之下，第二道脉搏回应着你自己的心跳。赐予已经开始生根。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your eyes follow movement in the dark before you consciously notice it."
msgstr "你还未意识到黑暗中的动静，双眼就已经追踪到了它。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh cannot mend now. You need a wound, food, strength and time to recover."
msgstr "肉体现在无法修复。你需要伤口、食物、体力，以及恢复所需的时间。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh yields to your will. You can let it unfold into a stronger, unfamiliar shape."
msgstr "肉体开始顺从你的意志。你可以让它展开为一种更强大而陌生的形态。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your skin parts into dark folds; the strength beneath it answers you."
msgstr "皮肤展开为暗色的褶皱，下面的力量回应了你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "ceremonial circle"
msgstr "仪式圆环"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "threshold of the calling"
msgstr "召唤的门槛"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*A breath escapes the figure. For an instant you see an immense world rotting and renewing itself, with no place set aside for mercy."
msgstr "*那身影吐出一口气。刹那间，你看到一个庞大的世界腐烂又重生，其中没有为怜悯留下位置。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Current objective: live through the changing flesh. Find food and a place to rest; your abilities will emerge over the next few days."
msgstr "*当前目标：熬过肉体的变化。寻找食物和休息之处；新的能力将在未来几天逐渐出现。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Five figures wait around the circle. “You followed the call. You may leave human, or accept a gift that will reshape you. But you cannot choose what form your soul will take.”"
msgstr "*五道身影在圆环旁等待。“你追随召唤而来。你可以以人类之身离开，也可以接受重塑你的恩赐。但你的灵魂会化作什么形态，并不由你选择。”"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The gift is taking root. Its abilities appear over several days; rest and food still matter. The weakness of your chosen form is already present. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*恩赐正在扎根。它的能力将在数日内出现；休息和食物依然不可或缺。新形态的弱点已经伴随着你。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The memories recede. “There is still time. Accept, and learn to bear what has touched you. Leave human, and the ceremony will take its price: perhaps your hearing, your sight, the steadiness of your hands, or the peace of your thoughts. More than one wound will remain. Is this still your answer?”"
msgstr "*记忆退去。“还有时间。接受恩赐，学会承受触碰过你的东西。以人类之身离开，仪式便会索取代价：也许是听觉、视力、双手的稳定，或思绪的安宁。留下的创伤不止一处。你仍坚持这个答案吗？”"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The silent figure watches you. In the folds beneath it, small shapes stir and vanish."
msgstr "*那沉默的身影注视着你。它身下的褶皱中，小小的轮廓蠕动着，又消失不见。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Conrad’s limited gift: heavy flesh, corrupting touch and toxic breath. You move more slowly; your clouds endanger companions and can still hurt you."
msgstr "*你承载着康拉德有限的恩赐：厚重的血肉、腐化触碰和剧毒吐息。你的行动更慢；毒雾危及同伴，也仍会伤害你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Conrad’s limited gift: heavy flesh, corrupting touch and toxic breath. You move more slowly; your clouds endanger companions and can still hurt you.\n\nThe gift is still growing. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*你承载着康拉德有限的恩赐：厚重的血肉、腐化触碰和剧毒吐息。你的行动更慢；毒雾危及同伴，也仍会伤害你。\n\n恩赐仍在成长。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Femto’s limited gift: pressure, a short rush and a slowing presence. Your stamina reserves are smaller, and rushing leaves you briefly exposed."
msgstr "*你承载着费蒙特有限的恩赐：压力、短距突进和迟滞的威压。你的耐力储备减少，突进后会短暂暴露破绽。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Femto’s limited gift: pressure, a short rush and a slowing presence. Your stamina reserves are smaller, and rushing leaves you briefly exposed.\n\nThe gift is still growing. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*你承载着费蒙特有限的恩赐：压力、短距突进和迟滞的威压。你的耐力储备减少，突进后会短暂暴露破绽。\n\n恩赐仍在成长。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Slan’s limited gift: night senses, stronger flesh, a cutting tendril and deliberate healing. Hunger and heat are its price."
msgstr "*你承载着斯兰有限的恩赐：夜间感官、强化血肉、切割触须和主动愈合。代价是饥饿与对热伤害的脆弱。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Slan’s limited gift: night senses, stronger flesh, a cutting tendril and deliberate healing. Hunger and heat are its price.\n\nThe gift is still growing. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*你承载着斯兰有限的恩赐：夜间感官、强化血肉、切割触须和主动愈合。代价是饥饿与对热伤害的脆弱。\n\n恩赐仍在成长。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Ubik’s limited gift: a borrowed likeness, confusion and brief concealment. Your body is weaker, and some minds resist the illusions."
msgstr "*你承载着尤比克有限的恩赐：虚空替身、感知混乱和短暂隐匿。你的身体变弱，某些心智则能抵抗幻象。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Ubik’s limited gift: a borrowed likeness, confusion and brief concealment. Your body is weaker, and some minds resist the illusions.\n\nThe gift is still growing. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*你承载着尤比克有限的恩赐：虚空替身、感知混乱和短暂隐匿。你的身体变弱，某些心智则能抵抗幻象。\n\n恩赐仍在成长。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Void’s limited gift: folded steps and a brief defense against an impact. Your body is weaker; the spaces between uses still leave you vulnerable."
msgstr "*你承载着波伊德有限的恩赐：空间折步和短暂的冲击防护。你的身体变弱；能力恢复期间仍然脆弱。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You bear Void’s limited gift: folded steps and a brief defense against an impact. Your body is weaker; the spaces between uses still leave you vulnerable.\n\nThe gift is still growing. No further dose is needed."
msgstr "*你承载着波伊德有限的恩赐：空间折步和短暂的冲击防护。你的身体变弱；能力恢复期间仍然脆弱。\n\n恩赐仍在成长。无需再次服用任何东西。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You returned from the ceremony human. Recover, examine its lasting wounds and decide which known road to follow."
msgstr "*你以人类之身从仪式中归来。恢复体力，了解它留下的永久创伤，再选择一条已知的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You returned human. The ceremony’s wounds grant no demonic strength. Their effects are listed among your traits."
msgstr "*你以人类之身归来。仪式的创伤不会赐予恶魔力量，其影响可以在特质中查看。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*“The gift will grow over several days. It grants strength and binds a weakness into your flesh. You will not become one of us. If you refuse, this passage will wound your senses and your mind instead. At least two scars will follow you. No human crosses this place untouched.”"
msgstr "*“恩赐会在数日内成长。它带来力量，也将弱点永久织入你的血肉。你不会成为我们的一员。若拒绝，这次穿越便会伤及你的感官与心智，至少留下两道伤痕。没有人类能毫发无损地经过这里。”"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A bitter corruption eats at living tissue."
msgstr "苦涩的腐化侵蚀着活体组织。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A black, falcon-shaped figure stands apart. Even near him, the distance seems impossible to cross."
msgstr "一道黑色猎鹰般的身影独自站立。即使靠近他，那距离似乎也无法跨越。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile borrowed outline. It has no substance once struck."
msgstr "脆弱的借来轮廓。挨上一击便会显露空无。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile, elongated shape sharpens perception of distance. Gain +2 dexterity, +1 dodge and 1 point of natural protection. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr "脆弱而细长的形态强化距离感。获得敏捷+2、闪避+1和1点天然防护。变形耗时2秒；维持每分钟消耗2千卡。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A heavy pressure slows movement."
msgstr "沉重的压力减缓行动。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A memory has many faces. We can turn it toward the one you refuse to see. Whether you trust that face is another matter."
msgstr "记忆有很多面孔。我们可以把你不愿看见的那一面转向你。你是否相信它，则是另一回事。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A nameless dread makes it harder to recover your composure after exertion. Stamina regeneration is reduced by 10%."
msgstr "无名的恐惧让你难以在劳累后平复。耐力恢复速度降低10%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A second pulse beats beneath your skin. Slan’s gift is taking root. You burn 25% more calories and take 20% more heat damage, even in your human shape."
msgstr "皮肤下跳动着第二道脉搏。斯兰的恩赐正在扎根。即使保持人形，热量消耗仍增加25%，受到的热伤害增加20%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A small cloud of toxic breath spreads around the chosen place."
msgstr "一小团剧毒吐息在选定位置周围扩散。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A small floating figure peers through round lenses. Its quiet amusement makes every memory feel uncertain."
msgstr "一道小小的悬浮身影透过圆形镜片窥视。它安静的笑意让每段记忆都显得不可靠。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A squat, silent figure waits in the folds of the ceremony. The air around it smells of decay."
msgstr "一个矮胖而沉默的身影在仪式的褶皱中等待。周围的空气散发着腐烂气息。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A winged figure stands amid living flesh. Her smile holds neither sympathy nor haste."
msgstr "一道有翼身影站在活体血肉之间。她的微笑既无同情，也无急切。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "An empty likeness occupies a nearby place."
msgstr "一个空虚的替身占据附近的位置。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "An immense pressure crushes the attacker."
msgstr "巨大的压力碾压袭击者。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "An immense, motionless figure with an exposed brain. The space around its fingers seems folded into itself."
msgstr "一个巨大而静止、脑部裸露的身影。它手指周围的空间仿佛向自身内部折叠。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle of black wings"
msgstr "黑翼使徒"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle of borrowed faces"
msgstr "借来面孔使徒"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle of cinder rot"
msgstr "灰烬腐化使徒"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle of folded space"
msgstr "空间折叠使徒"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Are these really my memories?"
msgstr "这些真的是我的记忆吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bend the impact"
msgstr "折转冲击"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Binding flesh"
msgstr "束缚血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Black wings"
msgstr "黑翼"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Black-winged rush"
msgstr "黑翼突进"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Blood has soaked into the stone without leaving a stain. Its face whispers: \"How long will you let others choose your fate?\" Answering leads to a ceremony from which you cannot return untouched. Its gift has permanent weaknesses; a final refusal also leaves lasting wounds."
msgstr "鲜血渗入石头，没有留下污迹。它的面孔低语：“你还要让别人决定自己的命运多久？”回应将带你走向无法完好归来的仪式。恩赐带来永久弱点；最终拒绝也会留下持久创伤。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed absence"
msgstr "借来的隐匿"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed face"
msgstr "借来的面孔"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed faces"
msgstr "借来面孔"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Breath of extinction"
msgstr "灭绝吐息"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Breath of rot"
msgstr "腐烂吐息"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Broken perception"
msgstr "破碎感知"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cinder rot"
msgstr "灰烬腐化"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Conflicting memories"
msgstr "矛盾记忆"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Corrupting touch"
msgstr "腐化触碰"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Crushing distance"
msgstr "碾压距离"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Crushing presence"
msgstr "压迫威势"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dark wings lighten your movements. Gain +2 strength, +1 dexterity, +10 speed and 2 points of natural protection; falling damage is halved. The wings do not allow sustained flight. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr "暗色翅膀令动作轻盈。获得力量+2、敏捷+1、速度+10和2点天然防护；坠落伤害减半。翅膀不支持持续飞行。变形耗时2秒；维持每分钟消耗2千卡。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Do you control my fate?"
msgstr "你掌控着我的命运吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dread of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀之恐惧"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Every road you took has brought you here. You may accept what waits beyond the limits of your body, or cling to those limits."
msgstr "你走过的每条路都将你带到这里。你可以接受肉体极限之外的事物，也可以紧抓着这些极限不放。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Flesh can become an instrument of desire. It can also become a hunger you must spend every day feeding. Strength does not mean peace."
msgstr "血肉可以成为欲望的工具，也可以成为你每天都必须喂养的饥饿。力量并不意味着安宁。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Folded distance"
msgstr "折叠距离"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Folded severance"
msgstr "空间断裂"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Folded space"
msgstr "空间折叠"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Folded step"
msgstr "空间折步"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Follow the blood-darkened Behelit? You will return changed, and survival will become harder. Accepting its gift brings permanent strengths and weaknesses; refusing at the ceremony leaves at least two lasting wounds to your senses or mind. Take what you need before entering."
msgstr "追随染血贝黑莱特的召唤？归来时你将发生改变，生存也会更加困难。接受恩赐会获得永久力量与弱点；在仪式中拒绝则至少留下两项持久的感官或精神创伤。进入前带好所需物品。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Fragments of the ceremony intrude when you try to concentrate. Your intelligence is reduced by 1."
msgstr "当你试图集中注意时，仪式的片段侵入思绪。智力降低1。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Gnawing rot"
msgstr "啃噬腐化"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I am ready to answer."
msgstr "我准备好回答了。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I want to hear the terms of the gift."
msgstr "我想听听恩赐的条件。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I will speak with the others."
msgstr "我去和其他人谈谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I will think about that."
msgstr "我会考虑这件事。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, breathe toxic gas into a small area within 3 tiles. Wind and terrain affect it; it can harm you and your companions. Costs 1500 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 40 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，向3格内的小片区域吐出毒气。风和地形会影响气体；它也会伤害你和同伴。消耗1500耐力和2秒；恢复时间40秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, corrupt an adjacent living enemy for 8 seconds, dealing 2 damage every 2 seconds. Robots, zombies and slimes are unaffected. Costs 700 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 12 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，腐化相邻活体敌人8秒，每2秒造成2点伤害。机器人、丧尸和黏液生物不受影响。消耗700耐力和1秒；恢复时间12秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, place one fragile likeness within 4 tiles for 8 seconds. Enemies may attack it; it does not force them to forget you. Costs 800 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，于4格内创造一个持续8秒的脆弱替身。敌人可能攻击它，但不会被迫忘记你。消耗800耐力和1秒；恢复时间20秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, push a visible enemy within 4 tiles away by up to 3 tiles. Obstacles can stop it. Costs 1600 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 25 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，将4格内可见的敌人向外推至多3格。障碍物可能阻挡它。消耗1600耐力和1秒；恢复时间25秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, reduce enemies’ speed by 20 in a small area within 5 tiles for 3 seconds. Costs 1800 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 35 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，使5格内小片区域中的敌人速度降低20，持续3秒。消耗1800耐力和2秒；恢复时间35秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, reduce the next damaging impact by 40% for up to 3 seconds. Costs 1400 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 45 seconds. Damage that ignores resistance can still pass through."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，将下一次造成伤害的冲击减弱40%，防护最多持续3秒。消耗1400耐力和1秒；恢复时间45秒。无视抗性的伤害仍可能穿透。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, rush to a visible, unoccupied place within 3 tiles. Costs 1200 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 15 seconds. For 2 seconds afterward, your dodge is reduced by 2. It does not grant flight through the sky."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，突进到3格内可见的空位。消耗1200耐力和1秒；恢复时间15秒。突进后闪避降低2，持续2秒。此能力不支持飞向天空。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, step to a visible, unoccupied place within 4 tiles. Costs 1000 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. A blocked destination does not consume strength."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，折步到4格内可见的空位。消耗1000耐力和1秒；恢复时间20秒。目的地被阻挡时不消耗力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, stun a living enemy within 5 tiles for 2 seconds. Robots, zombies, slimes and insects are unaffected. Costs 1100 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 25 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，使5格内的活体敌人眩晕2秒。机器人、丧尸、黏液生物和昆虫不受影响。消耗1100耐力和1秒；恢复时间25秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your other shape, vanish from ordinary sight for 4 seconds. Scent, sound and remembered positions can still betray you. Costs 1500 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 45 seconds."
msgstr "在异形姿态下，对普通视觉隐匿4秒。气味、声音和被记住的位置仍可能暴露你。消耗1500耐力和1秒；恢复时间45秒。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Intrusive memories"
msgstr "侵入性记忆"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let your other shape unfold first. You need strength and time before calling on this gift again."
msgstr "先展开你的异形姿态。再次使用恩赐前，你需要体力和恢复时间。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Living cords close around the attacker."
msgstr "活体束带缠绕袭击者。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Living tissue blackens beneath the touch."
msgstr "活体组织在触碰下变黑。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. A gift does not place its bearer among us. Decide whether the strength you may receive is worth the shape it will give your life."
msgstr "不。恩赐不会让承载者与我们并列。决定吧：你可能获得的力量，是否值得让它塑造你的人生。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Other people’s expressions linger in your thoughts. Your body loses some of its strength."
msgstr "别人的表情久久留在你的思绪中。身体失去了一部分力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Overwhelm a living enemy with conflicting sensations."
msgstr "用矛盾的感受淹没活体敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pressure gathers beneath your shoulder blades. Your reserves of stamina diminish."
msgstr "肩胛骨下积聚着压力。耐力储备减少。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pressure slows nearby enemies."
msgstr "压力迟滞附近敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Push an enemy away along the line of sight."
msgstr "沿视线将敌人推开。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rot overwhelms the attacker’s living tissue."
msgstr "腐烂淹没袭击者的活体组织。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rush to a visible, unoccupied place within 3 tiles."
msgstr "突进到3格内可见的空位。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "See 1 tile farther in darkness and take 50% less biological damage. This does not grant immunity to disease, infection or toxic gas."
msgstr "黑暗视野增加1格，受到的生物伤害降低50%。这不提供对疾病、感染或毒气的免疫。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed of black wings"
msgstr "黑翼之种"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed of borrowed faces"
msgstr "借来面孔之种"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed of cinder rot"
msgstr "灰烬腐化之种"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed of folded space"
msgstr "空间折叠之种"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses of black wings"
msgstr "黑翼感官"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses of borrowed faces"
msgstr "借来面孔感官"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses of cinder rot"
msgstr "灰烬腐化感官"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses of folded space"
msgstr "空间折叠感官"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Space bends around the next impact."
msgstr "空间围绕下一次冲击弯折。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Space closes across the attacker."
msgstr "空间横向闭合，截断袭击者。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Spent wings"
msgstr "耗竭之翼"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Step to a visible, unoccupied place within 4 tiles."
msgstr "折步到4格内可见的空位。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The Behelit calls: \"You need not remain powerless.\" Drench its face in blood to answer in another way. The passage it opens will change you, even if you ultimately refuse its gift; surviving afterward will be harder."
msgstr "贝黑莱特召唤：“你不必继续无力。”将鲜血浇在它的脸上，以另一种方式回应。它开启的道路会改变你，即使最终拒绝恩赐；归来后的生存将更加艰难。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The Behelit seems to call to you. Blood might make it answer differently. A recipe to drench a Behelit in blood is available in the crafting menu. This road will leave you changed, even if you refuse its gift."
msgstr "贝黑莱特似乎在召唤你。鲜血也许能令它作出另一种回应。制作菜单中已可使用“以鲜血浸透贝黑莱特”的配方。这条道路会改变你，即使你拒绝恩赐。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The attacker’s senses collapse beneath incompatible memories."
msgstr "袭击者的感官在无法相容的记忆下崩溃。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The five voices fall silent. The figures turn toward you."
msgstr "五道声音沉寂下来。那些身影转向你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift answers a new impulse. Its first fighting abilities are now yours."
msgstr "恩赐回应了新的冲动。它最初的战斗能力如今属于你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift sharpens your senses. Its permanent weakness remains even in your human shape."
msgstr "恩赐强化感官。即使保持人形，它的永久弱点仍然存在。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The transformation settles. It will grow no further; its strength and its price remain yours."
msgstr "蜕变已经稳定。它不会继续成长；力量与代价都将伴随你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold black wings"
msgstr "展开黑翼"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold borrowed faces"
msgstr "展开借来面孔"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold cinder rot"
msgstr "展开灰烬腐化"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold folded space"
msgstr "展开空间折叠"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Wave of pressure"
msgstr "压力冲波"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What are you offering?"
msgstr "你在提供什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What would happen to my body?"
msgstr "我的身体会怎样？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Would I become your equal?"
msgstr "我会与你平等吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You bear Slan’s limited gift; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your transformation is complete. Hunger, heat and exhaustion remain its price."
msgstr "你承载着斯兰有限的恩赐，却没有成为神之手的一员。蜕变已经完成。饥饿、炎热和疲惫仍是其代价。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have carried such fear in so small a body. Does it not tire you, holding yourself together?"
msgstr "这么小的身体承受了如此多恐惧。一直把自己维系在这界限内，不累吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have heard a call. You still have an answer to give. We will not give you the comfort of calling that answer harmless."
msgstr "你听到了召唤。你仍有一个答案要给出。我们不会用“这个答案无害”的承诺安慰你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have reached the end of the road that human strength opened. What will you do with the door beyond it?"
msgstr "你已走到人类力量所能开辟道路的尽头。你会如何对待它之后的那扇门？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You let the gift reshape your body."
msgstr "你让恩赐重塑身体。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You remember the life you brought here? Of course you do. But do you remember it kindly, or only as it hurt?"
msgstr "你还记得带到这里的人生吗？当然记得。但你是温柔地回忆它，还是只记得它的疼痛？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body draws back into its familiar shape."
msgstr "你的身体收回到熟悉的形态。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body feels light and frail; nearby distances seem uncertain."
msgstr "身体轻盈而脆弱；近处的距离显得不再可靠。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body has learned another shape. You can now call on it deliberately."
msgstr "你的身体学会了另一种形态。如今你可以主动将它唤起。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh grows thick and heavy. Gain +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. You remain slower, and gas can still hurt you. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr "血肉变得厚重。获得力量+3和3点天然防护。你仍行动较慢，毒气仍能伤害你。变形耗时2秒；维持每分钟消耗2千卡。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your movements are exposed after a sudden burst."
msgstr "迅猛突进后，你的动作暴露出破绽。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your outline becomes difficult to follow. Gain +2 dexterity and reduce your visibility range by 3 tiles. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr "你的轮廓难以辨识。获得敏捷+2，并将敌人看见你的距离减少3格。变形耗时2秒；维持每分钟消耗2千卡。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your outline vanishes from ordinary sight."
msgstr "你的轮廓从普通视野中消失。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your pulse slows. A bitter smell follows each breath; ordinary movement becomes slower."
msgstr "脉搏放缓。每次呼吸都带着苦涩气味；普通行动变得更慢。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your senses sharpen, while the gift’s weakness settles into your body."
msgstr "你的感官变得敏锐，恩赐的弱点也在身体中扎根。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Conrad; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr "你的蜕变已经完成。你承载着康拉德有限的恩赐，却没有成为神之手的一员。你的能力与弱点不会继续成长。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Femto; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr "你的蜕变已经完成。你承载着费蒙特有限的恩赐，却没有成为神之手的一员。你的能力与弱点不会继续成长。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Ubik; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr "你的蜕变已经完成。你承载着尤比克有限的恩赐，却没有成为神之手的一员。你的能力与弱点不会继续成长。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Void; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr "你的蜕变已经完成。你承载着波伊德有限的恩赐，却没有成为神之手的一员。你的能力与弱点不会继续成长。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "empty likeness"
msgstr "空虚替身"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Live through the borrowed flesh"
msgstr "熬过异身的蜕变"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift is changing you without another dose. Find food, water and a place to rest. Learn the weaknesses of your new body and wait for its final shape. Your road journal keeps a remembered trail to an ashen wound; follow it when you are prepared."
msgstr "恩赐会自行改变你，无须再次服药。寻找食物、水和休息之处，了解新身体的弱点，等待蜕变完成。行路日志保存着通向灰烬伤口的线索；准备好后再去。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You return to the living world. A broken road and an ashen wound linger behind your eyes. You record that trail in your road journal. Find food and somewhere to recover before following it."
msgstr "你回到生者的世界。破碎的道路与灰烬般的伤口仍在眼前盘旋。你把这条线索记入行路日志。追踪前先找些食物和能恢复体力的地方。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound cools and its heartbeat stops. This place has grown quieter; the flesh you brought back has not changed. Among the defenders’ marks you find three roads: a fortified residence, the Black Dogs’ camp and a misty valley. You preserve them in your road journal."
msgstr "伤口冷却，心跳止息。这里安静了些，你从彼界带回的身体却未改变。守卫留下的标记指向三条路：设防宅邸、黑犬营地和迷雾山谷。你将它们记入行路日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound does not answer. Its keeper must fall before you can reach the exposed heart of the breach."
msgstr "伤口没有回应。必须先击败守护者，才能触及裂隙裸露的核心。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your new flesh has settled. Follow the ashen trail when prepared, or choose another road you already know. The gift does not choose your enemies for you."
msgstr "*新身体已经定型。准备好后追踪灰烬线索，或选择另一条已知道路。恩赐不会替你选择敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Now: find food, water and a place to recover while your body changes. The ashen trail is preserved in your journal; it can wait until you are ready."
msgstr "*当前：寻找食物、水和休息之处，让身体继续蜕变。灰烬线索已记入日志，可以等你准备好。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You kept your human body. Recover and learn to live with the wounds of the ceremony. A remembered ashen trail gives you a road onward."
msgstr "*你保住了人身。恢复体力，学会与仪式留下的伤痕共存。记忆中的灰烬线索指明了后续道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The trail I brought back from the ceremony."
msgstr "从仪式带回的线索。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*A broken road, a ruined foundation, ash around a wound in the earth. The vision stayed with you when the voices fell silent. It may lead to another opening between the worlds. The journey is yours to choose; prepare a way to retreat."
msgstr "*破碎的道路，残毁的地基，大地伤口周围的灰烬。声音消失后，这幅景象仍留在记忆里。它也许通向另一处连接世界的入口。去不去由你决定；先准备好退路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Open the entry for the ashen trail."
msgstr "打开灰烬线索的条目。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review only the roads I already know."
msgstr "只查看已知道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The gift has only taken root. Its weakness is already yours. Find food and rest; your body will keep changing without another dose."
msgstr "*恩赐刚刚扎根，它的弱点已属于你。寻找食物和休息；身体无需再次服药便会继续改变。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your senses have changed. Give your body time to learn its next shape; the weakness you accepted has not gone away."
msgstr "*感官已发生变化。给身体时间掌握下一个形态；你接受的弱点并未消失。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your other shape is ready. You can call on it through the mutations menu. Changing shape does not heal wounds. Its fighting powers are still taking root."
msgstr "*异形已可在突变菜单中启用。变形不会治愈伤口，战斗能力仍在形成。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your first fighting powers are awake. Learn their cost and leave room to recover between uses. The last change has not yet settled."
msgstr "*首批战斗能力已经觉醒。了解它们的代价，并为每次使用后的恢复留出余地。最后的变化尚未完成。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You are an apostle bearing a limited gift. The necessary changes are complete; no further dose or growth is needed. Your powers, their costs and your weakness remain."
msgstr "*你已成为承载有限恩赐的使徒。必要变化全部完成，无需再服药或继续成长。能力、代价和弱点都将留下。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You refused the gift. The lasting wounds of the ceremony grant no demonic strength. Rest and prepare before following the ashen trail."
msgstr "*你拒绝了恩赐。仪式留下的伤痕不会给予恶魔之力。追踪灰烬线索前，先休息并做好准备。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "That body is no excuse to forget what your hands do. If you came for honest work, we can talk. Keep your quarrels away from the boy and my hearth."
msgstr "这副身体不是忘记双手所为的借口。若为正经活计而来，我们可以谈。别把争端带到孩子和我的炉边。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Something has changed in me. Can we talk?"
msgstr "我发生了变化。能谈谈吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted a gift beyond this world."
msgstr "我在彼界接受了一份恩赐。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I recognize you, but your body frightens me. Tell me what happened. I can still work on your equipment; that does not mean I have agreed to everything you do."
msgstr "我认得你，但你的身体让我害怕。告诉我发生了什么。我仍能帮你修装备，但这不代表我赞同你的一切。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I am Rickert. Please keep some distance while we talk. I have never seen a body like yours, but you came here speaking instead of attacking."
msgstr "我是里凯尔特。说话时请保持些距离。我从没见过这样的身体，但你来这里是为了交谈，而非攻击。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your gift makes this road more dangerous, not less. I will choose for myself whether to walk it. We need to speak about what you intend to do with that strength."
msgstr "你的恩赐让这条路更危险。我会自己决定是否同行。我们得先谈谈你打算如何使用这份力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Then let us talk about the gift first."
msgstr "那就先谈恩赐。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Iron does not care what lives beneath your skin. I care what you bring to my door. You may ask for work. Do not mistake that for permission to hurt the people under this roof."
msgstr "铁不会在意你皮肤下住着什么。我在意你给我的门带来什么。你可以委托工作，但别把这当成伤害屋檐下之人的许可。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Can the forge still help me?"
msgstr "锻坊还能帮我吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "How do I keep this strength from becoming my whole life?"
msgstr "怎样不让这份力量成为生命的全部？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A spark is bright and soon gone. The hearth keeps somebody warm after the hammer falls silent. Your new flesh can win a fight; it cannot tell you what deserves to survive it. Decide that before you reach for the fire."
msgstr "火花明亮，却转瞬即逝。锤声停止后，炉火仍能温暖人。新身体能赢得战斗，却无法告诉你什么值得活下来。伸手取火前，先想清楚。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You chose that gift? I cannot pretend it is an ordinary wound. But I will listen. Tell me whether you still mean to treat other people as people."
msgstr "是你自己选择了恩赐？我无法把它当成普通伤口。但我会听。告诉我，你还会把别人当人看吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted strength. I will not use people as tools."
msgstr "我接受了力量，但不会把人当作工具。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You can still help me without walking my road."
msgstr "你可以帮助我，而不必与我同行。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "With this power, people should obey me. So should you."
msgstr "有了这份力量，人们就该服从我。你也一样。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I am not ready to talk about it."
msgstr "我还不想谈。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I hope you mean that. I will still stay here; my answer about traveling has not changed. Bring the work to the forge if you need help."
msgstr "希望你是认真的。但我仍会留在这里，同行的决定不会改变。需要帮助就把活带到锻坊。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Then we can keep talking. A promise does not make the road safe, and I still have a say in whether I go. My crossbow and my tools are not yours to command."
msgstr "那我们可以继续谈。承诺不会让路途安全，是否同行仍由我决定。我的弩和工具不由你支配。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let us discuss the road as equals."
msgstr "平等地谈谈同行。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A gift from beyond the veil has taken root in you. I will not mistake it for the Brand. Sit by the hearth if you came to speak; the choice of what you do with this flesh is still yours."
msgstr "帷幕之外的恩赐已在你体内扎根。我不会把它错认成烙印。若为交谈而来，就坐到炉边；如何使用这副身体，仍由你选择。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you see in the gift I accepted?"
msgstr "你在我接受的恩赐中看到了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The change will continue on its own and then settle. More blood will not make you master it. Learn its hunger, its weakness and the time it needs to answer you. Closing a wound in the world will not undo your bargain."
msgstr "变化会自行持续，最终定型。更多鲜血不会让你掌控它。了解它的饥饿、弱点及回应所需的时间。封闭世界的伤口也无法撤销你的交易。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Does the gift oblige me to serve them?"
msgstr "恩赐是否迫使我侍奉他们？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Can the armor hide or cure this change?"
msgstr "铠甲能掩盖或治愈这种变化吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A gift and a command are different things. They have changed what you are capable of, but your next deed is still your own. Do not expect other apostles to welcome you as kin. Their appetites need not agree with yours."
msgstr "恩赐与命令并非一回事。他们改变了你的能力，下一步行动却仍属于你。不要指望其他使徒把你视为同族，他们的欲望未必与你相同。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. The armor cannot return the body you surrendered. It is another danger, with its own price. If you ask for it, understand both burdens before you trust either one in battle."
msgstr "不能。铠甲无法归还你舍弃的身体。它有另一种危险与代价。若要索取它，先理解这两重负担，再在战斗中依赖其中任何一种。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I did not carry you from that circle. You returned by its will, bearing its gift. I will hear you, but do not mistake this meeting for an alliance."
msgstr "我没有把你从那个圆环中带出。你依其意志返回，承载其恩赐。我会听你说，但别把这次相遇当成结盟。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You came back from the circle without its gift. The wounds it left are not the Brand. Ask what you need to know before I ride on."
msgstr "你从圆环返回，却没有接受恩赐。留下的伤痕不是烙印。趁我离开前，问出你需要知道的事。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What remains for someone who came back as I did?"
msgstr "像我这样回来的人，还能做什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Prepare for the road before testing what the ceremony left you. The ashen wound you remember can be closed, but it will not change your body back. Other wounds and their keepers remain. Decide which known trail is yours to follow; strength alone will not decide it."
msgstr "先为旅途做好准备，再试验仪式留下的东西。记忆中的灰烬伤口可以封闭，却不会还原你的身体。其他伤口与守护者仍在。选择属于你的已知线索，力量本身无法替你决定。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Are other apostles now my allies?"
msgstr "其他使徒现在是我的盟友吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let me keep these directions in my journal."
msgstr "让我把这些指引记入日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. You have received power, not their loyalty. An apostle can turn on another apostle. The people you meet will judge the shape before them and the deeds they witness. Choose what you show them."
msgstr "不是。你获得的是力量，不是他们的忠诚。使徒也会攻击其他使徒。遇到的人会依据眼前的形态与亲眼所见的行为判断你。决定给他们看什么。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound cools and its heartbeat stops. This place has grown quieter; the price of the ceremony remains with you. Among the defenders’ marks you find three roads: a fortified residence, the Black Dogs’ camp and a misty valley. You preserve them in your road journal."
msgstr "伤口冷却，心跳止息。这里安静了些，仪式的代价仍与你同在。守卫留下的标记指向三条路：设防宅邸、黑犬营地和迷雾山谷。你将它们记入行路日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I lost my road journal. Could I have another?"
msgstr "我弄丢了行路日志。能给我一本新的？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pliant flesh"
msgstr "柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your steps become heavier. Movement is 10 points slower, even in human shape."
msgstr "脚步沉重起来。即使在人形下速度也降低10。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Hunting beast"
msgstr "猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your muscles strain against a slower recovery. Stamina regeneration is reduced by 10%, even in human shape."
msgstr "肌肉需要休息。即使在人形下体力恢复也降低10%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged hunter"
msgstr "有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your skin grows thin and sensitive. Take 15% more bash, cut and stab damage, even in human shape."
msgstr "皮肤变薄且敏感。即使在人形下，受到的钝击、切割和刺穿伤害也增加15%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cinder carapace"
msgstr "焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A hot hunger settles into your body. Burn 35% more calories and recover stamina 15% more slowly, even in human shape."
msgstr "炽热的饥饿扎根体内。即使在人形下卡路里消耗也增加35%，体力恢复降低15%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold heavy, pliant flesh: +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. Your slower movement remains. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr "展开沉重柔韧的血肉：力量+3，自然防护3点，减速仍保留。变形需2秒，每分钟消耗3千卡，不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold a hunting beast: +3 strength, +15% melee damage and -2 dexterity. Your stamina still recovers slowly. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr "化作猎杀之兽：力量+3，近战伤害+15%，敏捷-2，体力恢复仍慢。变形需2秒，每分钟消耗3千卡，不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold insectlike wings: +2 dexterity, +15 speed and half falling damage. Wings permit gliding with a light load and usable arms, not free ascent into the sky. Torso encumbrance above 20 prevents your wing abilities. Your fragile flesh remains. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute."
msgstr "展开虫翼：敏捷+2，速度+15，坠落伤害减半。轻装且手臂可用时能够滑翔，不能自由升空。躯干累赘超过20会阻止翼技，脆弱的血肉仍保留。变形需2秒，每分钟消耗3千卡。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold a fiery carapace: +3 strength, 6 points of natural protection, -15 speed and 50% less heat damage. Hunger and slow recovery remain. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 5 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds or make fire harmless."
msgstr "展开火焰甲壳：力量+3，自然防护6点，速度-15，热伤害减少50%。饥饿与缓慢恢复仍保留。变形需2秒，每分钟消耗5千卡。不会治愈伤口，火仍有危险。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh sharpens your senses. Its weakness has taken root too."
msgstr "异来的血肉强化了感官，它的弱点也已扎根。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body has learned its other shape. You can now unfold it deliberately."
msgstr "身体已学会另一形态，现在可以主动展开。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fighting instinct wakes in the flesh. Your first new ability is ready."
msgstr "血肉中的战斗本能觉醒，首项新能力已就绪。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh has settled. This transformation is complete; its strength and its weakness remain."
msgstr "异来的血肉已定型，蜕变完成，力量与弱点都将留下。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body unfolds into the borrowed shape."
msgstr "身体展开为借来的形态。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed shape draws back beneath your skin."
msgstr "借来的形态缩回皮肤之下。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: pliant flesh"
msgstr "蜕变之种：柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: pliant flesh"
msgstr "感官：柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh sharpens your perception in darkness. Its lasting weakness remains in either shape."
msgstr "血肉强化暗处感知，其持久弱点在两种形态下都保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: pliant flesh"
msgstr "展开形态：柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: pliant flesh"
msgstr "使徒：柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your independent transformation is complete. You are a weaker likeness of the fallen apostle, not its rebirth or servant. No further portion is needed; the weakness remains."
msgstr "独立蜕变已完成。你是倒下使徒较弱的相似者，并非其重生或仆从。无须再吸收，弱点仍保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: hunting beast"
msgstr "蜕变之种：猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: hunting beast"
msgstr "感官：猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: hunting beast"
msgstr "展开形态：猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: hunting beast"
msgstr "使徒：猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: winged hunter"
msgstr "蜕变之种：有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: winged hunter"
msgstr "感官：有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: winged hunter"
msgstr "展开形态：有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: winged hunter"
msgstr "使徒：有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: cinder carapace"
msgstr "蜕变之种：焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: cinder carapace"
msgstr "感官：焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: cinder carapace"
msgstr "展开形态：焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: cinder carapace"
msgstr "使徒：焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "the Count's undying flesh"
msgstr "伯爵的不朽血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Wyald's undying flesh"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德的不朽血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rosine's undying flesh"
msgstr "罗西娜的不朽血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Grunbeld's undying flesh"
msgstr "古伦贝鲁多的不朽血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the Count’s flesh? You will slowly become a heavy, pliant apostle. Your movement will remain slower, even in human shape. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward. You cannot undo the choice by closing a breach."
msgstr "吸收伯爵的血肉？你将逐渐变成沉重而柔韧的使徒，即使在人形下行动也会变慢。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线，封闭裂隙也不能撤销蜕变。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Wyald’s flesh? You will slowly become a beastlike apostle. Your stamina will recover more slowly; precise work will suffer in your fighting shape. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收瓦伊阿尔德的血肉？你将逐渐变成兽形使徒。体力恢复变慢，战斗形态不利于精细工作。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Rosine’s flesh? You will slowly become a winged insectlike apostle. Your flesh will take more physical damage, even in human shape. Heavy equipment restricts your winged movements. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收罗西娜的血肉？你将逐渐变成有翼的虫形使徒，即使在人形下也承受更多物理伤害。重装备限制翅膀动作。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Grunbeld’s flesh? You will slowly grow an armored, fiery shape. Hunger and slow stamina recovery remain even in human shape; breathing fire overheats your body. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收古伦贝鲁多的血肉？你将逐渐长出披甲的火焰形态。饥饿和缓慢的体力恢复在人形下也会保留，喷火会使身体过热。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "This severed flesh still pulses and does not decay. It is no ordinary food. Deliberately absorbing it begins a lasting transformation into a weaker, independent likeness of its former owner. One portion is enough for the whole change. Another lineage cannot be combined with it."
msgstr "割下的血肉仍在跳动，不会腐烂。它不是普通食物。主动吸收将开始不可逆的蜕变，成为前主人较弱而独立的相似形态。一份足以完成变化，无法与其他谱系结合。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the flesh"
msgstr "吸收血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh remains in your hands. Your body cannot accept this path, or another change has already taken root."
msgstr "血肉仍留在你手中。你的身体不能接受这条道路，或另一种变化已扎根。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh dissolves beneath your skin. The change has begun and will finish without another portion. Find food, water and somewhere to rest; your road journal records its progress."
msgstr "血肉在皮肤下消融。蜕变已开始，无需再吸收。寻找食物、水和休息之处；行路日志会记下进程。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A remnant of the fallen apostle still pulses among the cooled folds. It has not decayed."
msgstr "冷却的褶皱间，倒下使徒的残片仍在跳动，尚未腐烂。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Exposed flesh"
msgstr "暴露的血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy strike leaves you exposed for a moment."
msgstr "重击使你短暂暴露。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Crushing grip"
msgstr "压制抓握"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A crushing grip slows movement."
msgstr "强力抓握减慢动作。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Restless wings"
msgstr "灵动之翼"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Swift wingbeats help you avoid an attack."
msgstr "迅速振翅有助躲避攻击。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Overheated carapace"
msgstr "过热甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Heat trapped in your flesh slows you and prevents another fiery breath."
msgstr "血肉中积聚的热量使你减速，无法再次喷火。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Braced carapace"
msgstr "稳固甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your braced shell offers extra protection at the cost of movement."
msgstr "撑稳的甲壳提供额外防护，但减慢移动。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pliant tendril"
msgstr "柔韧触肢"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Strike with a heavy tendril."
msgstr "以沉重触肢打击。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, strike an enemy within 2 tiles for 20 bash damage. Costs 900 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 16 seconds. Dodge is reduced by 2 for 3 seconds afterward."
msgstr "战斗形态下打击2格内敌人，造成20钝击伤害。消耗900体力和2秒，16秒恢复；之后3秒闪避-2。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "This ability needs your fighting shape, enough strength and time to recover. Winged movements also need room for your equipment."
msgstr "此能力需要战斗形态、足够体力和恢复时间。束缚身体的装备也会妨碍翼技。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Draw flesh together"
msgstr "聚拢血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, heal 3 HP on each injured major body part. Costs 1000 stamina, 80 kcal and 3 seconds; recovers in 2 minutes. It cannot regrow a lost hand or eye. No cost when you are uninjured."
msgstr "战斗形态下每个受伤主要部位恢复3HP。消耗1000体力、80千卡和3秒，2分钟恢复；不能再生失去的手或眼睛。无伤时不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast rush"
msgstr "野兽突进"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rush along an open path."
msgstr "沿畅通路径突进。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, rush up to 3 tiles along an open path. Walls and creatures stop the rush. Costs 1200 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. A fully blocked or canceled rush costs nothing."
msgstr "战斗形态下沿畅通路径突进最多3格，墙壁和生物会阻挡。消耗1200体力和1秒，18秒恢复；完全受阻或取消不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast grip"
msgstr "野兽抓握"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Slow a nearby enemy with a crushing grip."
msgstr "抓握压制近处敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, deal 10 bash damage to an adjacent enemy and slow it by 25 for 4 seconds. Costs 900 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. This does not make the enemy helpless."
msgstr "战斗形态下对相邻敌人造成10钝击伤害，4秒内速度-25。消耗900体力和1秒，18秒恢复；敌人仍能行动。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged dive"
msgstr "展翼俯冲"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dive along an open path."
msgstr "沿畅通路径俯冲。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged sweep"
msgstr "振翼横扫"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cut nearby enemies after landing."
msgstr "落点附近斩击敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, dive up to 4 tiles along an open path, then deal 18 cut damage to enemies next to the landing. Costs 1500 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20. Your dodge is reduced by 2 for 2 seconds afterward. A fully blocked or canceled dive costs nothing."
msgstr "战斗形态下沿畅通路径俯冲最多4格，对落点邻近敌人造成18切割伤害。消耗1500体力和1秒，20秒恢复；躯干累赘须不高于20，之后2秒闪避-2。完全受阻或取消不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Evasive wingbeats"
msgstr "避击振翅"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, gain +2 dodge for 3 seconds. Costs 700 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20."
msgstr "战斗形态下3秒内闪避+2。消耗700体力和1秒，20秒恢复；躯干累赘须不高于20。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cinder breath"
msgstr "焰烬吐息"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Breathe a narrow cone of fire."
msgstr "喷出狭窄火锥。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, breathe fire in a narrow cone up to 5 tiles for 26 heat damage. The flames can burn you, companions and belongings. Costs 1800 stamina, 60 kcal and 2 seconds; recovers in 45 seconds. You overheat for 12 seconds, losing 15 speed and the ability to breathe fire again."
msgstr "战斗形态下向5格内喷出狭窄火锥，造成26热伤害。火可伤害自己、伙伴和物品。消耗1800体力、60千卡和2秒，45秒恢复；过热12秒，速度-15且不能再喷火。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Brace the shell"
msgstr "撑稳甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, gain 3 extra points of natural protection for 4 seconds, but lose 20 speed. Costs 1100 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 30 seconds. It grants no invulnerability."
msgstr "战斗形态下4秒内自然防护额外+3，速度-20。消耗1100体力和1秒，30秒恢复，不会无敌。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Live through the apostle’s flesh"
msgstr "熬过使徒血肉的蜕变"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You deliberately absorbed the remains of a fallen apostle. Find food, water and rest while your body changes. One portion is enough; learn your new abilities and their weaknesses, then continue a road you already know."
msgstr "你主动吸收了倒下使徒的残片。身体蜕变时寻找食物、水和休息。一份已经足够，了解新能力与弱点，再继续已知的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The absorbed flesh is changing you on its own. Secure food, water and a resting place. Its weakness remains in both shapes. Continue the roads you already know when prepared; no new dose is needed."
msgstr "*吸收的血肉会自行改变你。备好食物、水和休息之处，其弱点在两种形态下都保留。准备好后继续已知道路，无需再吸收。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh I absorbed."
msgstr "我吸收的血肉。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your independent transformation is growing from a single absorbed remain. The weakness is permanent. Early senses appear first; the fighting shape and its abilities follow."
msgstr "*独立蜕变源于一份残片。弱点永久保留，先出现新感官，之后是战斗形态和能力。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Pliant flesh: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr "*柔韧血肉：蜕变已完成，无须再吸收或成长。继续已知道路，能力与代价仍保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Hunting beast: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr "*猎杀之兽：蜕变已完成，无须再吸收或成长。继续已知道路，能力与代价仍保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Winged hunter: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr "*有翼猎手：蜕变已完成，无须再吸收或成长。继续已知道路，能力与代价仍保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Cinder carapace: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr "*焰烬甲壳：蜕变已完成，无须再吸收或成长。继续已知道路，能力与代价仍保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review the roads I already know."
msgstr "查看已知道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "My body is changing. Can we talk about it?"
msgstr "我的身体在变化，能谈谈吗？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You took that flesh into yourself? I need to know what you intend to do now. I can still work on your equipment, but I will decide for myself whether we travel together."
msgstr "你把那血肉吸收进去了？我得知道你接下来想做什么。我仍能帮你修装备，但是否同行由我决定。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The fallen apostle’s flesh has found a new bearer. It will settle without another portion. Learn its hunger and weakness. Victory over its former owner does not spare you the price, and closing a breach will not undo the change."
msgstr "倒下使徒的血肉找到了新的载体，无须再吸收就会定型。了解其饥饿和弱点。战胜前主人不会免去代价，封闭裂隙也不能撤销变化。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The apostle fell, but you chose to carry its flesh within you. That choice does not erase what came before. I will answer your questions while I remain here; do not expect its power to make the other apostles loyal to you."
msgstr "使徒倒下了，但你选择将其血肉纳入自身。这一选择不会抹去过去。我还在此时会回答问题，别指望这份力量换来其他使徒的忠诚。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What should I do with this change?"
msgstr "该如何面对这场变化？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Learn the body you have chosen: its hunger, its recovery and where it leaves you vulnerable. You have gained strength, not an answer to every wound in the world. Your known roads remain; prepare before following them."
msgstr "了解自己选择的身体：饥饿、恢复以及脆弱之处。你获得了力量，却不是对世界所有伤口的答案。已知的道路仍在，先准备再出发。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Answered impulse"
msgstr "血肉的回应"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh answers a completed impulse."
msgstr "血肉回应完成的意念。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your senses have changed. The weakness of the absorbed flesh remains even in human shape; prepare food and rest while the body continues to change."
msgstr "*感官已改变。吸收血肉的弱点在人形下仍保留；备好食物与休息，让身体继续蜕变。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You can deliberately unfold your fighting shape. Learn its strengths and limitations before risking another hunt. The fighting abilities are still developing."
msgstr "*你已能主动展开战斗形态。再次狩猎前了解其力量与限制，战斗能力仍在形成。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The first fighting ability is ready. Learn its cost and recovery; another ability will follow when the flesh settles."
msgstr "*首项战斗能力已就绪。了解消耗与恢复；血肉定型时会再获得一项能力。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you see in the change within me?"
msgstr "你在我体内的变化中看到了什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh of a fallen apostle has taken root in you. It is a different wound from the Brand. If you came to speak, sit by the hearth. What you do with this body remains your choice."
msgstr "倒下使徒的血肉已在你体内扎根，这与烙印是不同的创伤。若为交谈而来，就坐到炉边。如何使用这个身体仍由你选择。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The offer is withdrawn. The apostle advances."
msgstr "提议被收回，使徒开始逼近。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your attack breaks the pact. The borrowed body remains, but its master’s protection and favor are gone."
msgstr "攻击撕毁契约。借来的身体仍在，但主人的庇护与恩惠已消失。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The bond falls silent. Your master is dead; your body remains a limited servant’s shape. No greater power takes its place."
msgstr "纽带沉寂了。主人已死，你仍保留有限的仆从形态，并未获得更高的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "正在倾听"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The creature pauses to hear an answer."
msgstr "这个生物停下等待回答。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Servant of the Count"
msgstr "伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Child of the false valley"
msgstr "虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Carapace vassal"
msgstr "甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your altered flesh slows you in either shape. The Count shelters his own, but only while the pact holds. Your strength will never equal his."
msgstr "变异血肉使两种形态都变慢。契约有效时伯爵才庇护你，你永远无法达到他的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Stamina returns more slowly, and beast hands hinder precise work. Wyald’s favor feeds your strongest impulse; you remain his lesser fighter."
msgstr "体力恢复变慢，兽爪妨碍精细操作。最强招式依赖瓦伊阿尔德的恩惠，你仍是弱小的战士。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Words become awkward clicks, persuasion falters and crafting slows. Your body is fragile. You can still choose, speak and act; Rosine has not made you a mindless creature."
msgstr "言语变成笨拙的鸣声，说服和制作更困难，身体脆弱。但你仍能选择、交谈和行动，没有失去心智。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy body moves more slowly and needs more food, even without the fighting shell. You serve Grunbeld; this lesser shell will never grow into his dragon."
msgstr "沉重的身体即使不披甲也更慢、更饥饿。你侍奉古伦贝鲁多，弱小甲壳不会变成他的巨龙。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh settles into another change."
msgstr "借来的血肉形成了新的变化。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "契约庇护：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your master and their marked servants leave you alone while you keep the pact. This protects you alone; it does not command demons or make them loyal to your companions."
msgstr "守约时主人与其变异仆从不会攻击你。庇护只属于你，不能命令恶魔，也不保护同伴。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "仆从感官：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "展开形态：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "借来的招式：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your limited fighting impulse requires recent service to your living master. The body and its weaknesses remain if the bond breaks, but this impulse falls silent."
msgstr "有限招式需要近期侍奉仍活着的主人。纽带断裂后身体和弱点保留，但招式沉寂。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "棋子：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The limited servant’s body is complete. Neither more flesh nor the master’s death will turn it into an independent apostle. Your choices remain your own, but the pact has a lasting price."
msgstr "有限的仆从身体已经定型。更多血肉或主人的死亡都不会使你成为独立使徒。你仍能决定，但契约的代价永远存在。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "契约庇护：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "仆从感官：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "展开形态：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "借来的招式：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "棋子：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "契约庇护：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "仆从感官：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "展开形态：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "借来的招式：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "棋子：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "契约庇护：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "仆从感官：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "展开形态：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "借来的招式：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "棋子：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring two pieces of leather for the household stores. In return I will nourish the strength I gave you."
msgstr "为家中仓库带来两块皮革，我就滋养赐给你的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring twelve scraps of metal for my men’s gear. Earn your next burst of strength."
msgstr "带来十二块废金属修整手下的装备，换取下一次力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring four pieces of animal meat to feed the nest. Then you may use the gift again."
msgstr "带来四块兽肉喂养巢穴，才能再次使用恩赐。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring four steel lumps for the damaged armor. Service earns strength; the shell alone does not."
msgstr "带来四块钢修整破损盔甲。侍奉才能换来力量，仅有甲壳还不够。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master and their servants will spare you, but not necessarily your companions. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master; betraying them ends their protection. Their death will not free you into a stronger form."
msgstr "接受契约？身体将不可逆地变成较弱仆从，并有永久缺陷，无法接受其他主要蜕变。主人与仆从会饶过你，但未必饶过同伴。最强招式需要向活着的主人交付物资；背叛会失去庇护，主人的死亡不会带来更强形态。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The pact takes root beneath your skin. Its price and your first service are recorded in the road journal."
msgstr "契约在皮肤下扎根，代价与首次差事已记入行路日志。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your offering is accepted. For six hours the bond will answer your fighting impulse."
msgstr "供奉已收下，接下来的六小时纽带将回应战斗招式。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Count"
msgstr "首次侍奉：伯爵"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Wyald"
msgstr "首次侍奉：瓦伊阿尔德"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Rosine"
msgstr "首次侍奉：罗西娜"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Grunbeld"
msgstr "首次侍奉：古伦贝鲁多"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed strike"
msgstr "借来的打击"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A limited impulse of the master’s flesh."
msgstr "主人血肉的有限冲动。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The impulse does not answer. Assume your fighting shape, recover your stamina and honor the service owed to a living master."
msgstr "招式没有回应。展开战斗形态，恢复体力，并履行对活着主人的侍奉。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed defense"
msgstr "借来的防护"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your lesser form briefly braces itself."
msgstr "弱小形态短暂做好防御。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A place at my court, walls between you and the night. I can make you worth keeping. Look at my servants: none need fear exile, so long as they remember whom they serve."
msgstr "在我的宫廷中得到一席之地，让城墙隔开黑夜。我能使你值得庇护。看看仆从，只要记得服侍谁，就不怕被逐出。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You’ve got nerve. Forget the rules that keep weak men crawling. Run with the Black Dogs, and I’ll give you claws to match it. Just remember: even a beast knows who leads the pack."
msgstr "你有胆量。忘掉束缚弱者的规则，和黑犬同行，我就赐你利爪。但野兽也知道谁是首领。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Why go back where everyone hurts you? Stay with us. You can be light and quick, and never alone again. Don’t mind their voices; they hardly need words here."
msgstr "为什么回到人人伤害你的地方？留下吧，你会轻快敏捷，不再孤独。别在意他们的声音，这里几乎不需要言语。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile body is no answer to the battles ahead. I offer a shell and a place among those who endure. You will serve, not reign. Decide before taking another step toward me."
msgstr "脆弱的身体无法面对未来战斗。我赐予甲壳和坚韧者中的位置。你将侍奉，而非统治。再靠近之前决定。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The uniforms hang on bodies that no longer fit them. One servant bows before the Count has even spoken. You would gain shelter, but not an equal’s freedom."
msgstr "制服挂在不再适合它们的身体上。一名仆从未等伯爵开口就鞠躬。你得到庇护，却不会得到平等的自由。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "His men keep out of reach of his hands. The promise of freedom ends wherever Wyald’s amusement begins. The strength he offers is a leash with teeth."
msgstr "手下躲在他的双手触及之外。瓦伊阿尔德开始取乐时，自由也就结束了。他的力量是一条带牙的绳索。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The little shapes around the nest chirr instead of answering. Their human belongings lie among torn cocoons. You would keep your will, but words and skilled hands would become harder to use."
msgstr "巢边的小生物以鸣声代替回答，人的物品散落在破茧间。你保留意志，但言语与灵巧双手将更难使用。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The armor bears scars of service rather than honor. He offers endurance, not his dragon’s fire. The heavy shell would remain even if its owner stopped answering."
msgstr "盔甲留下的是服役伤痕而非荣誉。他赐予耐力而非巨龙之火。即便主人不再回应，沉重甲壳也会保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Back to your offer."
msgstr "回到你的提议。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "There is no offer now. The apostle has chosen battle."
msgstr "现在没有提议，使徒选择了战斗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What will happen to me?"
msgstr "我会变成什么？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you expect in return?"
msgstr "你期望什么回报？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accept. Let me weigh the price once more."
msgstr "我接受，让我再衡量一次代价。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I will not serve you."
msgstr "我不会侍奉你。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Here are the supplies you demanded."
msgstr "这是你要求的物资。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Enough. I am leaving."
msgstr "够了，我要离开。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies."
msgstr "*契约将你变成弱小仆从。准备食物与休息，向主人交付约定物资才能使用最强招式，恩惠持续六小时。攻击主人或其变异仆从将撕毁契约。主人死后身体仍有限。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The master is dead. Your servant’s body and weaknesses remain. Their favor cannot be renewed, and no stronger form has replaced yours. Continue the roads you already know."
msgstr "*主人已死，仆从身体与弱点仍在，恩惠无法续期，也未获得更强形态。继续已知道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You broke the pact. Its protection and strongest impulse are gone; the lesser body and its weaknesses remain. No second main transformation can replace it."
msgstr "*你撕毁了契约，庇护与最强招式已失去，弱小身体和缺陷保留，无法用其他主线替换。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "My pact and service."
msgstr "我的契约与侍奉。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "So you took a master along with that body. I can still work steel for you, but I won’t pretend a leash is freedom. What you do next is still yours to answer for."
msgstr "你得到身体，也得到了主人。我仍能替你锻钢，但不会把绳索叫作自由。下一步仍由你负责。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You agreed to serve one of them? I can repair equipment, but I need to know where you stand. I won’t follow orders from your master, and coming with you remains my decision."
msgstr "你答应侍奉他们之一？我能修装备，但必须知道你的立场。我不会听你主人的命令，是否同行由我决定。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The power has a tether. You remain able to choose, but breaking the pact cannot restore the body you had. Nor will your master’s death make you their equal. Learn the price before you spend this strength."
msgstr "力量带着束缚。你仍能选择，但撕毁契约不会恢复身体，主人的死亡也不会让你与他平等。使用前先认识代价。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your master’s servants may spare you. That is not command over demons. Other apostles owe you nothing, and companions who trust you have not accepted your pact."
msgstr "主人的仆从或许饶过你，但不是让你支配恶魔。其他使徒不欠你什么，信任你的同伴也没有接受契约。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master will spare you; this does not protect companions or command every demon at the site. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master; betrayal ends their protection. Their death will not give a stronger form. You abandon the hunt against this master."
msgstr "接受契约？身体将不可逆地变成较弱仆从，并有永久缺陷，无法接受其他主线。主人会饶过你，但不能保护同伴或支配当地所有恶魔。最强招式需要交付物资；背叛失去庇护，主人死亡不会带来更强形态。你将放弃对他的狩猎。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review my pact."
msgstr "查看我的契约。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your service has been accepted. The borrowed impulse is sustained for now; no further supplies are due until that favor fades."
msgstr "你的侍奉已被接受，借来的招式暂时得到支持，恩惠消退之前无需再交物资。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr "站在那里回答。如果拒绝提议，我们便是敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A place at my court, walls between you and the night. I can make you worth keeping. Look at my servants: none need fear exile, so long as they remember whom they serve. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr "在我的宫廷中得到一席之地，让城墙隔开黑夜。我能使你值得庇护。看看仆从，只要记得服侍谁，就不怕被逐出。 站在那里回答。如果拒绝提议，我们便是敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You’ve got nerve. Forget the rules that keep weak men crawling. Run with the Black Dogs, and I’ll give you claws to match it. Just remember: even a beast knows who leads the pack. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr "你有胆量。忘掉束缚弱者的规则，和黑犬同行，我就赐你利爪。但野兽也知道谁是首领。 站在那里回答。如果拒绝提议，我们便是敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Why go back where everyone hurts you? Stay with us. You can be light and quick, and never alone again. Don’t mind their voices; they hardly need words here. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr "为什么回到人人伤害你的地方？留下吧，你会轻快敏捷，不再孤独。别在意他们的声音，这里几乎不需要言语。 站在那里回答。如果拒绝提议，我们便是敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile body is no answer to the battles ahead. I offer a shell and a place among those who endure. You will serve, not reign. Decide before taking another step toward me. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr "脆弱的身体无法面对未来战斗。我赐予甲壳和坚韧者中的位置。你将侍奉，而非统治。再靠近之前决定。 站在那里回答。如果拒绝提议，我们便是敌人。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring two pieces of leather for the household stores. In return I will nourish the strength I gave you."
msgstr "*契约将你变成弱小仆从。准备食物与休息，向主人交付约定物资才能使用最强招式，恩惠持续六小时。攻击主人或其变异仆从将撕毁契约。主人死后身体仍有限。 为家中仓库带来两块皮革，我就滋养赐给你的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring twelve scraps of metal for my men’s gear. Earn your next burst of strength."
msgstr "*契约将你变成弱小仆从。准备食物与休息，向主人交付约定物资才能使用最强招式，恩惠持续六小时。攻击主人或其变异仆从将撕毁契约。主人死后身体仍有限。 带来十二块废金属修整手下的装备，换取下一次力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring four pieces of animal meat to feed the nest. Then you may use the gift again."
msgstr "*契约将你变成弱小仆从。准备食物与休息，向主人交付约定物资才能使用最强招式，恩惠持续六小时。攻击主人或其变异仆从将撕毁契约。主人死后身体仍有限。 带来四块兽肉喂养巢穴，才能再次使用恩赐。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring four steel lumps for the damaged armor. Service earns strength; the shell alone does not."
msgstr "*契约将你变成弱小仆从。准备食物与休息，向主人交付约定物资才能使用最强招式，恩惠持续六小时。攻击主人或其变异仆从将撕毁契约。主人死后身体仍有限。 带来四块钢修整破损盔甲。侍奉才能换来力量，仅有甲壳还不够。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted an apostle’s pact. What remains mine?"
msgstr "我接受了使徒的契约，还有什么属于我？"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your will remains. The master holds a power you accepted, not every deed you may choose. Breaking the pact ends the shelter it offered; it will not return your old flesh. Nor does killing its giver make you their equal. Learn your limits before another battle."
msgstr "意志仍属于你。主人掌握的是你接受的力量，而非所有未来行动。撕毁契约将失去庇护，但无法恢复身体。杀死赐予者也不会让你与他平等。下次战斗前认识自己的限制。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The bond no longer answers. Your will remains, and so does the lesser flesh you accepted. Neither a broken oath nor a dead master restores humanity or grants their full strength. Choose the next road with the body you truly have."
msgstr "纽带已不再回应。意志仍在，接受的弱小血肉也仍在。破誓或主人死亡都不能恢复人身或赐予他的完整力量。用现在的身体选择下一条路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master will spare you; this does not protect companions or command every demon at the site. Do not attack the master or their marked servants, and keep companions from attacking them: their attack also breaks your pact. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master. Betrayal ends their protection; their death gives no stronger form. You abandon the hunt against this master."
msgstr "接受契约？身体将不可逆地变成较弱仆从，并有永久缺陷，无法接受其他主线。主人会饶过你，但不能保护同伴或支配所有恶魔。不要攻击主人和标记的仆从，也要阻止同伴攻击，否则同样会撕毁契约。最强招式需要交付物资。背叛失去庇护，主人死亡不会带来更强形态。你将放弃对他的狩猎。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your offering is accepted. Its support will not be wasted while your body grows: the fighting impulse will be sustained for its first six hours after awakening."
msgstr "供奉已收下，身体成长时不会白白消耗支持；战斗招式觉醒后的头六小时将得到滋养。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "restore up to 6 HP to each major body part. Costs 1200 stamina, 60 kcal and 6 seconds; recovers in 10 minutes. It cannot restore a missing hand or eye."
msgstr "在展开的形态下，为每个主要身体部位恢复最多6点生命值。消耗1200体力、60千卡和6秒；10分钟后可再次使用。无法恢复失去的手或眼睛。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "strike a visible enemy up to 3 tiles away with a cutting tendril. Costs 800 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 15 seconds."
msgstr "在展开的形态下，用锋利的触须攻击3格以内可见的敌人。消耗800体力和1秒；15秒后可再次使用。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanently altered flesh grants +4 strength, +1 dexterity, +15% melee damage and 4 points of natural protection. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible. Its growth does not heal wounds."
msgstr "永久改变的肉体提供力量+4、敏捷+1、近战伤害+15%以及4点自然防护。无法恢复人形，新身体的生长不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body of the crimson flesh"
msgstr "绯红血肉之躯"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You cannot lash out now. Your body must finish changing; you need strength and time to recover."
msgstr "现在无法挥出触须。身体需要完成变化，你需要体力和恢复时间。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh has changed into a stronger, unfamiliar body. It will never return to human shape."
msgstr "肉体已经变成更强大而陌生的身体，永远无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Strike a visible enemy up to 3 tiles away with a cutting tendril. Costs 800 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 15 seconds."
msgstr "用切割触须攻击3格内可见敌人。消耗800体力和1秒，15秒恢复。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Restore up to 6 HP to each major body part. Costs 1200 stamina, 60 kcal and 6 seconds; recovers in 10 minutes. It cannot restore a missing hand or eye."
msgstr "每个主要身体部位恢复最多6HP。消耗1200体力、60千卡和6秒，10分钟恢复。无法恢复失去的手或眼睛。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile, elongated shape sharpens perception of distance. Gain +2 dexterity, +1 dodge and 1 point of natural protection. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "脆弱而细长的形态强化距离感。获得敏捷+2、闪避+1和1点天然防护。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A second pulse beats beneath your skin. Slan’s gift is taking root. You burn 25% more calories and take 20% more heat damage, throughout the transformation."
msgstr "皮肤下跳动着第二道脉搏。斯兰的恩赐正在扎根。即使保持人形，热量消耗仍增加25%，受到的热伤害增加20%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dark wings lighten your movements. Gain +2 strength, +1 dexterity, +10 speed and 2 points of natural protection; falling damage is halved. The wings do not allow sustained flight. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "暗色翅膀令动作轻盈。获得力量+2、敏捷+1、速度+10和2点天然防护；坠落伤害减半。翅膀不支持持续飞行。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body must finish changing. You need strength and time before calling on this gift again."
msgstr "身体需要完成变化。再次使用恩赐前，你需要体力和恢复时间。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift sharpens your senses. Its permanent weakness remains throughout the transformation."
msgstr "恩赐强化感官。即使保持人形，它的永久弱点仍然存在。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body has changed permanently. Its new strengths and weaknesses cannot be switched off."
msgstr "身体已经永久改变，新的力量和弱点无法关闭。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh grows thick and heavy. Gain +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. You remain slower, and gas can still hurt you. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "血肉变得厚重。获得力量+3和3点天然防护。你仍行动较慢，毒气仍能伤害你。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your outline becomes difficult to follow. Gain +2 dexterity and reduce your visibility range by 3 tiles. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "你的轮廓难以辨识。获得敏捷+2，并将敌人看见你的距离减少3格。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body of folded space"
msgstr "折叠空间之躯"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body of borrowed faces"
msgstr "借面之躯"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body of cinder rot"
msgstr "灰烬腐朽之躯"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body of black wings"
msgstr "黑翼之躯"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your body has changed permanently; returning to human shape is impossible. The change does not heal wounds. Its fighting powers are still taking root."
msgstr "*身体已永久改变，无法恢复人形。蜕变不会治愈伤口，战斗能力仍在形成。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your steps become heavier. Movement is 10 points slower, throughout the transformation."
msgstr "脚步沉重起来。在整个蜕变过程中速度也降低10。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your muscles strain against a slower recovery. Stamina regeneration is reduced by 10%, throughout the transformation."
msgstr "肌肉需要休息。在整个蜕变过程中体力恢复也降低10%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your skin grows thin and sensitive. Take 15% more bash, cut and stab damage, throughout the transformation."
msgstr "皮肤变薄且敏感。在整个蜕变过程中，受到的钝击、切割和刺穿伤害也增加15%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A hot hunger settles into your body. Burn 35% more calories and recover stamina 15% more slowly, throughout the transformation."
msgstr "炽热的饥饿扎根体内。在整个蜕变过程中卡路里消耗也增加35%，体力恢复降低15%。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy, pliant body grants +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. Your slower movement remains. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr "永久沉重柔韧的身体提供：力量+3，自然防护3点，减速仍保留。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形，也不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your beastlike body grants +3 strength, +15% melee damage and -2 dexterity. Your stamina still recovers slowly. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr "永久兽形身体提供：力量+3，近战伤害+15%，敏捷-2，体力恢复仍慢。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形，也不会治愈伤口。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanently grown insectlike wings grant +2 dexterity, +15 speed and half falling damage. Wings permit gliding with a light load and usable arms, not free ascent into the sky. Torso encumbrance above 20 prevents your wing abilities. Your fragile flesh remains. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "永久虫翼提供：敏捷+2，速度+15，坠落伤害减半。轻装且手臂可用时能够滑翔，不能自由升空。躯干累赘超过20会阻止翼技，脆弱的血肉仍保留。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent fiery carapace grants +3 strength, 6 points of natural protection, -15 speed and 50% less heat damage. Hunger and slow recovery remain. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible. It does not heal wounds or make fire harmless."
msgstr "永久火焰甲壳提供：力量+3，自然防护6点，速度-15，热伤害减少50%。饥饿与缓慢恢复仍保留。身体永久改变，无法恢复人形。不会治愈伤口，火仍有危险。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh sharpens your perception in darkness. Its lasting weakness remains throughout the transformation."
msgstr "血肉强化暗处感知，其持久弱点在整个蜕变过程中都保留。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: pliant flesh"
msgstr "身体：柔韧血肉"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: hunting beast"
msgstr "身体：猎杀之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: winged hunter"
msgstr "身体：有翼猎手"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: cinder carapace"
msgstr "身体：焰烬甲壳"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the Count’s flesh? You will slowly become a heavy, pliant apostle. Your movement will remain slower, throughout the transformation. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward. You cannot undo the choice by closing a breach."
msgstr "吸收伯爵的血肉？你将逐渐变成沉重而柔韧的使徒，在整个蜕变过程中行动也会变慢。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线，封闭裂隙也不能撤销蜕变。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Wyald’s flesh? You will slowly become a beastlike apostle. Your stamina will recover more slowly; your altered hands will hinder precise work. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收瓦伊阿尔德的血肉？你将逐渐变成兽形使徒。体力恢复变慢，变异的手会妨碍精细工作。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Rosine’s flesh? You will slowly become a winged insectlike apostle. Your flesh will take more physical damage, throughout the transformation. Heavy equipment restricts your winged movements. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收罗西娜的血肉？你将逐渐变成有翼的虫形使徒，在整个蜕变过程中也承受更多物理伤害。重装备限制翅膀动作。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Grunbeld’s flesh? You will slowly grow an armored, fiery shape. Hunger and slow stamina recovery remain throughout the transformation; breathing fire overheats your body. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr "吸收古伦贝鲁多的血肉？你将逐渐长出披甲的火焰形态。饥饿和缓慢的体力恢复在整个蜕变过程中都会保留，喷火会使身体过热。选择不可逆，之后无法接受其他主线。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Strike an enemy within 2 tiles for 20 bash damage. Costs 900 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 16 seconds. Dodge is reduced by 2 for 3 seconds afterward."
msgstr "打击2格内敌人，造成20钝击伤害。消耗900体力和2秒，16秒恢复；之后3秒闪避-2。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Heal 3 HP on each injured major body part. Costs 1000 stamina, 80 kcal and 3 seconds; recovers in 2 minutes. It cannot regrow a lost hand or eye. No cost when you are uninjured."
msgstr "每个受伤主要部位恢复3HP。消耗1000体力、80千卡和3秒，2分钟恢复；不能再生失去的手或眼睛。无伤时不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rush up to 3 tiles along an open path. Walls and creatures stop the rush. Costs 1200 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. A fully blocked or canceled rush costs nothing."
msgstr "沿畅通路径突进最多3格，墙壁和生物会阻挡。消耗1200体力和1秒，18秒恢复；完全受阻或取消不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Deal 10 bash damage to an adjacent enemy and slow it by 25 for 4 seconds. Costs 900 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. This does not make the enemy helpless."
msgstr "对相邻敌人造成10钝击伤害，4秒内速度-25。消耗900体力和1秒，18秒恢复；敌人仍能行动。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dive up to 4 tiles along an open path, then deal 18 cut damage to enemies next to the landing. Costs 1500 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20. Your dodge is reduced by 2 for 2 seconds afterward. A fully blocked or canceled dive costs nothing."
msgstr "沿畅通路径俯冲最多4格，对落点邻近敌人造成18切割伤害。消耗1500体力和1秒，20秒恢复；躯干累赘须不高于20，之后2秒闪避-2。完全受阻或取消不消耗。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Gain +2 dodge for 3 seconds. Costs 700 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20."
msgstr "3秒内闪避+2。消耗700体力和1秒，20秒恢复；躯干累赘须不高于20。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Breathe fire in a narrow cone up to 5 tiles for 26 heat damage. The flames can burn you, companions and belongings. Costs 1800 stamina, 60 kcal and 2 seconds; recovers in 45 seconds. You overheat for 12 seconds, losing 15 speed and the ability to breathe fire again."
msgstr "向5格内喷出狭窄火锥，造成26热伤害。火可伤害自己、伙伴和物品。消耗1800体力、60千卡和2秒，45秒恢复；过热12秒，速度-15且不能再喷火。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Gain 3 extra points of natural protection for 4 seconds, but lose 20 speed. Costs 1100 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 30 seconds. It grants no invulnerability."
msgstr "4秒内自然防护额外+3，速度-20。消耗1100体力和1秒，30秒恢复，不会无敌。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your independent transformation is growing from a single absorbed remain. The weakness is permanent. Early senses appear first; the permanent body and its abilities follow."
msgstr "*独立蜕变源于一份残片。弱点永久保留，先出现新感官，之后是永久形态和能力。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your senses have changed. The weakness of the absorbed flesh remains throughout the transformation; prepare food and rest while the body continues to change."
msgstr "*感官已改变。吸收血肉的弱点在整个蜕变过程中仍保留；备好食物与休息，让身体继续蜕变。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your body has changed permanently. Learn its strengths and limitations before risking another hunt. The fighting abilities are still developing."
msgstr "*身体已永久改变。再次狩猎前了解其力量与限制，战斗能力仍在形成。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your altered flesh slows you throughout the transformation. The Count shelters his own, but only while the pact holds. Your strength will never equal his."
msgstr "变异血肉在整个蜕变过程中使你变慢。契约有效时伯爵才庇护你，你永远无法达到他的力量。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy body moves more slowly and needs more food, throughout the transformation. You serve Grunbeld; this lesser shell will never grow into his dragon."
msgstr "沉重的身体在整个蜕变过程中都更慢、更饥饿。你侍奉古伦贝鲁多，弱小甲壳不会变成他的巨龙。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent pliant body grants +1 strength and 2 points of natural protection, with another -5 speed. Returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "永久柔韧身体提供力量+1、自然防护2点，速度额外-5。无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent beastlike body grants +2 strength and -2 dexterity. Returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "永久兽形身体提供力量+2、敏捷-2。无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent insectlike body grants +1 dexterity and +8 speed. Its fragility and difficulties with speech and crafting remain. Returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "永久虫形身体提供敏捷+1、速度+8。脆弱及言语与制作困难仍然存在。无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent carapace grants +1 strength, 3 points of natural protection and 25% less heat damage, with another -8 speed. Returning to human shape is impossible."
msgstr "永久甲壳提供力量+1、自然防护3点，热伤害降低25%，速度额外-8。无法恢复人形。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: Servant of the Count"
msgstr "身体：伯爵的异形仆从"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr "身体：黑犬之兽"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: Child of the false valley"
msgstr "身体：虚假山谷的居民"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Body: Carapace vassal"
msgstr "身体：甲壳附庸"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The impulse does not answer. Let your body finish changing, recover your stamina and honor the service owed to a living master."
msgstr "招式没有回应。等待身体完成变化，恢复体力，并履行对活着主人的侍奉。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The absorbed flesh is changing you on its own. Secure food, water and a resting place. Its weakness remains throughout the transformation. Continue the roads you already know when prepared; no new dose is needed."
msgstr "*吸收的血肉会自行改变你。备好食物、水和休息之处，其弱点在整个蜕变过程中都保留。准备好后继续已知道路，无需再吸收。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "broken fitting"
msgstr "损坏的零件"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Only a worn fastening remains."
msgstr "只剩下磨损的固定件。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I hid this before they counted us. The cage doors are tied, not locked with iron keys. Untie them from either side and pass through; the quarry is longer but stays open. One name at the bottom is followed by a small word: escaped."
msgstr "我在点名前藏下了这张纸。笼门用绳子绑着，并没有铁锁。从任何一侧解开就能通过；采石场的路更长，但仍然畅通。底部一个名字旁写着小字：逃走了。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "We called the stone a miracle because we needed one. We moved it behind the altar and stopped opening the door to strangers. When the whispers began, we thought we had been answered. The handprints on the altar were not made in prayer."
msgstr "我们称这块石头为奇迹，因为我们需要奇迹。把它搬到祭坛后，不再为陌生人开门。低语响起时，我们以为祈祷得到了回应。祭坛上的手印却并非祈祷留下的。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The transport order is crossed out. Below it: Three of us described the same red face after sleeping here. When we moved the specimen, the scratching began outside its new tent. Pavel is hurt; the creature caught him when he stepped into the open. Cancel collection of the sample. Send transport for the wounded. We are leaving the equipment."
msgstr "运输命令被划掉。下面写着：我们三个人在这里睡过后，都描述了同一张红脸。转移样本后，新帐篷外开始响起抓挠声。帕维尔走到空地时被那个生物追上，已经受伤。取消采集样本。派车接走伤员。装备留下。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Mikhail, if you reach the camp first: we moved the wounded into the southwestern tent. The creature came out of the northern tent and caught Pavel in the open. Keep behind the canvas and use the gap in the eastern cordon. We are leaving before dusk. — Lena"
msgstr "米哈伊尔，如果你先回到营地：伤员已移到西南帐篷。那个生物从北边帐篷出来，在空地追上了帕维尔。躲在帐篷帆布后，走东侧围栏的缺口。我们会在黄昏前离开。——列娜"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The last prayer has been crossed out. Beneath it: We barred the front doors to keep the strangers away. Now the footsteps are inside. Irina took the remaining blankets through the sacristy; I could not persuade her to come back for the stone. The western wall is broken. Follow the living while there is still time."
msgstr "最后的祈祷被划掉。下面写着：我们堵住正门，不让陌生人进来。现在脚步声却在里面。伊琳娜从圣器室搬走了剩下的毯子；我无法劝她回来拿石头。西墙已经破了。趁还有时间，跟着活人走。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A folded warning is tied to a stake beside the southern entrance. Rain has blurred the first line, but directions for the wounded are still legible."
msgstr "南侧入口的木桩上绑着一张折叠警告。雨水模糊了第一行，但给伤员的指示仍可辨认。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A rain-marked warning left for a late-arriving member of the survey team. It describes the wounded and a way out of the camp."
msgstr "一张被雨淋过的警告，留给迟到的调查队员，说明伤员的位置和离开营地的道路。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Day two: the case was moved to the northeastern tent after three people reported the same face in their dreams. Day three: Pavel was attacked between the tents. Day four: Lena brought the wounded to the medical tent. The final transport request is unsigned. Most of the equipment was left packed, as if departure was only minutes away."
msgstr "第二天：三人梦见同一张脸后，箱子被搬到东北帐篷。第三天：帕维尔在帐篷之间遇袭。第四天：列娜把伤员搬进医疗帐篷。最后的运输申请没有签名。大部分装备仍装在包里，仿佛马上就要离开。"

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "String marks the successive positions of the measuring instruments. Each day the circle was moved farther from the case. Beside it, a sleep log repeats the same three names and the same sketch of a red face. The last line records the attack on Pavel."
msgstr "绳子标记了测量仪器此前的位置。每天圆圈都离箱子更远。旁边的睡眠日志反复记着三个名字和同一张红脸草图。最后一行记录了帕维尔遭袭。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A corrosive touch eats into a nearby enemy."
msgstr "腐蚀性的触碰侵蚀附近的敌人。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A caustic breath strikes the area and leaves toxic fumes."
msgstr "腐蚀性的吐息袭击目标区域，留下有毒烟雾。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Rending rush"
msgstr "撕裂冲锋"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A violent rush ends in a sweeping blow."
msgstr "猛烈的冲锋以横扫结束。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change at once and forever. You will owe service to the one who changes you."
msgstr "接受契约？你的身体将立刻发生永久改变。你必须为改变你的人效力。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Dawn reaches the refuge. You have survived the night."
msgstr "晨光照进庇护所。你熬过了这一夜。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your body has reached its final shape. The power you accepted is part of you."
msgstr "你的身体已达到最终形态。接受的力量已成为你的一部分。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Deal 40 acid damage to an enemy within 2 tiles. Costs 700 stamina; recovers in 12 seconds."
msgstr "对2格内的敌人造成40点酸蚀伤害。消耗700耐力，冷却12秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Deal 24 acid damage in an area within 6 tiles and leave toxic fumes. Allies can be harmed. Costs 1500 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 40 seconds."
msgstr "对6格内的一片区域造成24点酸蚀伤害并留下毒雾，也可能伤害同伴。消耗1500耐力及2秒，冷却40秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A tendril strikes within 3 tiles for 40 bash damage. Costs 900 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 16 seconds. Briefly leaves you exposed."
msgstr "触手攻击3格内的敌人，造成40点钝击伤害。消耗900耐力及2秒，冷却16秒。攻击后会短暂露出破绽。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Mend up to 7 HP on each major body part. Costs 1000 stamina, 80 kcal and 3 seconds; recovers in 2 minutes. Lost organs do not regrow."
msgstr "为各主要身体部位恢复最多7点生命值。消耗1000耐力、80千卡及3秒，冷却2分钟。无法再生失去的器官。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your master strengthens this ability in return for service. Your changed body remains even without their support."
msgstr "主人以这项力量回报你的效劳。即使失去他的支持，改变的身体也不会复原。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your body bears the lasting mark of the pact."
msgstr "你的身体承受着契约留下的永久印记。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Strike for 35 bash damage within 7 tiles, then push the enemy back up to 5 tiles. Costs 1600 stamina; recovers in 25 seconds."
msgstr "攻击7格内的敌人，造成35点钝击伤害，随后将其击退最多5格。消耗1600耐力，冷却25秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Rush to a visible free place within 6 tiles. Costs 1200 stamina; recovers in 15 seconds. Your dodge briefly worsens afterward."
msgstr "冲向6格内可见的空地。消耗1200耐力，冷却15秒。冲刺后闪避会短暂下降。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Crush an area within 7 tiles for 20 bash damage and slow enemies by 40 for 6 seconds. Costs 1800 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 35 seconds."
msgstr "压迫7格内的一片区域，造成20点钝击伤害，并使敌人的速度降低40，持续6秒。消耗1800耐力及2秒，冷却35秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Breathe fire up to 7 tiles for 52 heat damage. Flames can harm allies and belongings. Costs 1800 stamina, 60 kcal and 2 seconds; recovers in 45 seconds. Briefly overheats your body."
msgstr "向前喷火，最远7格，造成52点热伤害。火焰会伤害同伴及物品。消耗1800耐力、60千卡及2秒，冷却45秒。身体会短暂过热。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Brace your shell for 7 extra protection for 8 seconds, losing 20 speed. Costs 1100 stamina; recovers in 30 seconds."
msgstr "绷紧甲壳，额外获得7点防护，持续8秒，但速度降低20。消耗1100耐力，冷却30秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Dive up to 7 tiles and cut enemies around the landing for 36 damage. Costs 1500 stamina; recovers in 20 seconds. Heavy torso gear hinders the dive."
msgstr "俯冲最多7格，对落点附近的敌人造成36点斩击伤害。消耗1500耐力，冷却20秒。躯干上的沉重装备会妨碍俯冲。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Gain +4 dodge for 5 seconds. Costs 700 stamina; recovers in 20 seconds. Heavy torso gear hinders wingbeats."
msgstr "闪避增加4，持续5秒。消耗700耐力，冷却20秒。躯干上的沉重装备会妨碍振翅。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Strike with a tendril for 48 cutting damage within 5 tiles. Costs 800 stamina; recovers in 15 seconds."
msgstr "用触手攻击5格内的敌人，造成48点斩击伤害。消耗800耐力，冷却15秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Mend up to 12 HP on each major body part. Costs 1200 stamina, 60 kcal and 6 seconds; recovers in 10 minutes. Lost organs do not regrow."
msgstr "为各主要身体部位恢复最多12点生命值。消耗1200耐力、60千卡及6秒，冷却10分钟。无法再生失去的器官。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Create a likeness within 7 tiles for 20 seconds. Costs 800 stamina; recovers in 20 seconds."
msgstr "在7格内制造一个幻影，持续20秒。消耗800耐力，冷却20秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Stun living minds around a point within 7 tiles for 4 seconds. Machines, undead, slimes and insects are unaffected. Costs 1100 stamina; recovers in 25 seconds."
msgstr "使7格内目标点附近具有生命心智的敌人眩晕4秒。对机器、亡灵、史莱姆及昆虫无效。消耗1100耐力，冷却25秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Vanish from ordinary sight for 8 seconds. Scent and sound remain. Costs 1500 stamina; recovers in 45 seconds."
msgstr "从普通视觉中消失8秒，气味与声音仍会暴露你。消耗1500耐力，冷却45秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Step to a visible free place within 8 tiles. Costs 1000 stamina; recovers in 20 seconds."
msgstr "移至8格内可见的空地。消耗1000耐力，冷却20秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Bend space around the next blow, reducing damage by 70% for up to 4 seconds. Costs 1400 stamina; recovers in 45 seconds."
msgstr "扭曲空间，使下一次攻击的伤害降低70%，最多持续4秒。消耗1400耐力，冷却45秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Rush up to 6 tiles along an open path. Costs 1200 stamina; recovers in 18 seconds."
msgstr "沿畅通路径冲锋最多6格。消耗1200耐力，冷却18秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Crush an adjacent enemy for 28 bash damage and slow it by 40 for 6 seconds. Costs 900 stamina; recovers in 18 seconds."
msgstr "对相邻敌人造成28点钝击伤害，并使其速度降低40，持续6秒。消耗900耐力，冷却18秒。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your flesh settles into an unfamiliar shape."
msgstr "你的血肉逐渐形成陌生的模样。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your body is not ready for this movement."
msgstr "身体尚未准备好做出这个动作。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your senses shift. Familiar things feel different."
msgstr "你的感官发生改变，熟悉的事物带来不同的感觉。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A new strength answers your will."
msgstr "新的力量回应了你的意志。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The changes subside. This is your body now."
msgstr "变化逐渐平息。这就是你如今的身体。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "You cannot call on this strength yet."
msgstr "你还无法唤起这股力量。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The bond falls silent. Your changed flesh remains."
msgstr "联系沉寂了，改变的血肉依然存在。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The pact reshapes your flesh."
msgstr "契约重塑了你的血肉。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The strength you call upon remains silent."
msgstr "你呼唤的力量毫无回应。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A heavy tendril lashes the enemy."
msgstr "沉重的触手抽打敌人。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Rush forward and strike nearby enemies."
msgstr "向前冲锋并攻击附近的敌人。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Heavy, pliant flesh weighs down your movements."
msgstr "沉重而柔韧的血肉拖慢了你的动作。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The shell weighs upon your body. Every movement takes effort."
msgstr "甲壳压在身上，每次移动都需要用力。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Speech breaks into awkward clicks. Your delicate body makes patient work difficult."
msgstr "话语变成笨拙的咔嗒声，纤弱的身体让细致工作更加困难。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your limbs ache with restless strength. Fine work becomes harder."
msgstr "四肢充满躁动的力量，精细工作变得困难。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your altered flesh braces against danger."
msgstr "改变的血肉绷紧以抵御危险。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The change has begun. What about my order?"
msgstr "变化已经开始了，我的订单怎么办？"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Then I will not finish this blade for you. Take back the materials you brought."
msgstr "那我不会替你完成这把剑。拿回你带来的材料吧。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Return my materials."
msgstr "把材料还给我。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The armor cannot undo your change. I will not place another dangerous power upon it. You may still rest here, and we can speak of the road ahead."
msgstr "铠甲无法消除你的变化。我不会再为你增添另一股危险的力量。但你仍可在这里休息，我们也可以谈谈前方的路。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Spectral tendril"
msgstr "幽影触手"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A heavy tendril lashes outward."
msgstr "沉重的触手向外抽打。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The apparition gathers its strength."
msgstr "幻影正在积蓄力量。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Cinder gust"
msgstr "余烬热风"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A short cone of heat spills from the apparition."
msgstr "一道短促的热流从幻影中涌出。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Crimson cord"
msgstr "绯红肉索"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A cord of flesh lashes a distant target."
msgstr "血肉长索抽向远处的目标。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Uncertain footing"
msgstr "虚幻落脚"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Conflicting sensations disturb movement."
msgstr "彼此矛盾的感知妨碍了行动。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Bitter exhalation"
msgstr "腐蚀吐息"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A bitter cloud eats into nearby flesh."
msgstr "刺鼻的雾气侵蚀附近的血肉。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Your senses disagree about the ground beneath you."
msgstr "你的感官对脚下的地面产生了矛盾的判断。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of the Count"
msgstr "伯爵的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A swollen likeness fills the passage. Its heavy flesh wavers at the edges."
msgstr "膨胀的幻形堵住通道，沉重血肉的边缘摇曳不定。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The apparition lashes out with a heavy tendril!"
msgstr "幻影挥出沉重的触手！"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Wyald"
msgstr "怀亚尔德的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A grinning, beastlike likeness moves in sudden bounds."
msgstr "咧嘴的兽形幻影突然跳跃着移动。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Rosine"
msgstr "罗西妮的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A delicate winged apparition darts above the ground."
msgstr "纤细的有翼幻影在地面上方飞掠。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Grunbeld"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A heavy armored likeness radiates a brief, wavering heat."
msgstr "厚甲幻形散发出短暂而摇曳的热浪。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Heat spills from the apparition!"
msgstr "热浪从幻影中涌出！"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Slan"
msgstr "斯兰的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A crimson likeness of living flesh reaches through a thin place in the world."
msgstr "绯红的血肉幻形从世界薄弱之处伸来。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A crimson cord lashes outward!"
msgstr "绯红肉索向外抽打！"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Ubik"
msgstr "尤比克的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A small hovering image blurs whenever your gaze shifts."
msgstr "一转移目光，小小的浮空幻影便模糊起来。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The hovering image confuses your senses!"
msgstr "浮空幻影扰乱了你的感官！"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Projections of Conrad"
msgstr "康拉德的投影"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "A squat likeness gathers amid a bitter, drifting haze."
msgstr "矮胖的幻形在刺鼻的雾气中聚拢。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The apparition exhales a bitter cloud!"
msgstr "幻影吐出刺鼻的云雾！"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Absorb the Count’s flesh? It will begin changing your body forever."
msgstr "吞噬伯爵的血肉？它将开始永久改变你的身体。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Absorb Wyald’s flesh? It will begin changing your body forever."
msgstr "吞噬怀亚尔德的血肉？它将开始永久改变你的身体。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Absorb Rosine’s flesh? It will begin changing your body forever."
msgstr "吞噬罗西妮的血肉？它将开始永久改变你的身体。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "Absorb Grunbeld’s flesh? It will begin changing your body forever."
msgstr "吞噬古伦贝尔德的血肉？它将开始永久改变你的身体。"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The change has begun. What about the long sword?"
msgstr "变化已经开始了，长剑的订单怎么办？"

#. Restored 3.3 gameplay fixes
msgid "The change has begun. What about the Dragonslayer?"
msgstr "变化已经开始了，斩龙剑的订单怎么办？"

